(1088121, 132849, 24925, '<td valign="top">Now this is just great!!  The similarity between father in son are so incredibly striking...from the clothing to that distinctive look on the face (the son seems to be imitating the father!), you have really captured a thousand words in this photo!<br/> <br/>Very nice!  8.</td>', 'Now this is just great!!  The similarity between father in son are so incredibly striking...from the clothing to that distinctive look on the face (the son seems to be imitating the father!), you have really captured a thousand words in this photo! Very nice!  8.', '2005-01-03 01:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
