(1088182, 131566, 31307, '<td valign="top">Action shots are tricky but you seem to have some experience...or great luck.  Either way, I like the angle on the shot--how you get the rabbit in the photo.<br/> <br/>That dog with the red vest looks like a killer.</td>', 'Action shots are tricky but you seem to have some experience...or great luck.  Either way, I like the angle on the shot--how you get the rabbit in the photo. That dog with the red vest looks like a killer.', '2005-01-03 02:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088183, 132106, 31307, '<td valign="top">Nice expression on the woman''s face.  Thanks goodness for cooking accidents (it is burned or something, right?).</td>', 'Nice expression on the woman''s face.  Thanks goodness for cooking accidents (it is burned or something, right?).', '2005-01-03 02:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088192, 131875, 31307, '<td valign="top">Knowing how kids just LOVE to be photographed (that''s sarcasm), this must have been one of those "from the hip" shots.  Course, I wasn''t there and you might not have had to do it like that.<br/> <br/>The way he''s leaining works to make the photo more interesting and realistic--one can imagine him in the midst of playing with his...Woody character?</td>', 'Knowing how kids just LOVE to be photographed (that''s sarcasm), this must have been one of those "from the hip" shots.  Course, I wasn''t there and you might not have had to do it like that. The way he''s leaining works to make the photo more interesting and realistic--one can imagine him in the midst of playing with his...Woody character?', '2005-01-03 02:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
