(1088213, 131531, 25655, '<td valign="top">I simply love your shot ! <br/>The technique is wonderful, I love the fact that your subject is still anonymous. It gives the picture a very dynamic feeling. Just like a part of a movie!<br/>Amazing and my favorite! 10</td>', 'I simply love your shot ! The technique is wonderful, I love the fact that your subject is still anonymous. It gives the picture a very dynamic feeling. Just like a part of a movie!Amazing and my favorite! 10', '2005-01-03 02:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
