(1088322, 131684, 31213, '<td valign="top">I love the serious look.  He means business.  You must have shot this with a pretty long lens.  Looks great...even though I wish I could see the whistle a little better, I still know what it is.  Great job.</td>', 'I love the serious look.  He means business.  You must have shot this with a pretty long lens.  Looks great...even though I wish I could see the whistle a little better, I still know what it is.  Great job.', '2005-01-03 04:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088324, 132786, 31213, '<td valign="top">I keep looking at this picture and seem to pick up more from it each time I look.  I love how you leave off the top of the person walking by.  Did he come out that dark or did you do it in post.  Very nice.  I also think the smug look on the bum adds a lot of feeling to the picture.  It is that "let down, but no surprise" look.  Some may complain about the blown out side walk but it can be forgiven in this shot.  Great job!</td>', 'I keep looking at this picture and seem to pick up more from it each time I look.  I love how you leave off the top of the person walking by.  Did he come out that dark or did you do it in post.  Very nice.  I also think the smug look on the bum adds a lot of feeling to the picture.  It is that "let down, but no surprise" look.  Some may complain about the blown out side walk but it can be forgiven in this shot.  Great job!', '2005-01-03 04:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088325, 132643, 31213, '<td valign="top">Overrall nice shot...that being said, I do have some comments.  First of all....is this really candid or was it setup?  If it really was candid, then great job!  I like the composition, them on the right side of the photo and the bag still on the empty bench.  I don''t like the hazziness artound their heads.  Its almost a soft focu and I really wish that was sharper.  I also don''t care much for the bench behind the wall....its distracting and could have been very easy to crop out.  Nice job.</td>', 'Overrall nice shot...that being said, I do have some comments.  First of all....is this really candid or was it setup?  If it really was candid, then great job!  I like the composition, them on the right side of the photo and the bag still on the empty bench.  I don''t like the hazziness artound their heads.  Its almost a soft focu and I really wish that was sharper.  I also don''t care much for the bench behind the wall....its distracting and could have been very easy to crop out.  Nice job.', '2005-01-03 04:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
