(1088591, 132894, 24846, '<td valign="top">I didn''t think an animal candid would excite me but I was wrong. Great shot of this pooch who really looks to be enjoying the activity. The background woman''s barely detectable smile adds to this as well (bokem ?)Good luck.</td>', 'I didn''t think an animal candid would excite me but I was wrong. Great shot of this pooch who really looks to be enjoying the activity. The background woman''s barely detectable smile adds to this as well (bokem ?)Good luck.', '2005-01-03 11:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088594, 132724, 24846, '<td valign="top">Very effective in b/w. Good luck.</td>', 'Very effective in b/w. Good luck.', '2005-01-03 11:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088600, 132881, 24846, '<td valign="top">Like the very contemplative look. I like how he may or may not be with the couple.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Like the very contemplative look. I like how he may or may not be with the couple.Good luck.', '2005-01-03 11:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088602, 132888, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice captur on this sweet lady. Good luck</td>', 'Nice captur on this sweet lady. Good luck', '2005-01-03 11:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088606, 132727, 24846, '<td valign="top">I can hear him giggling.  Good luck.</td>', 'I can hear him giggling.  Good luck.', '2005-01-03 11:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088613, 132611, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, like the b/wand lighting. Good luck</td>', 'Nice capture, like the b/wand lighting. Good luck', '2005-01-03 11:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088618, 132002, 24846, '<td valign="top">Like the desat and happy smile of your capture. Good luck.</td>', 'Like the desat and happy smile of your capture. Good luck.', '2005-01-03 11:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088619, 132669, 24846, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh, I can hear him. Great capture.</td>', 'Ohhhh, I can hear him. Great capture.', '2005-01-03 11:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088622, 132212, 15207, '<td valign="top">The colours are really nicehere and there''s nice expression. I find the noise in the image a bit distracting (too many dots). Also, it may enhance a photo like this to have one main subject with other players in the background. Having one subject to focus the eye will allow the eye to move around to the other subjects and will add a bit more of a pleasing aspect to the photo. Think of your photo as divided by three horizontally and vertically, then think of how one subject can really hold attention in one of those nine spots/positions. The subject should ideally be a bit bigger than the others. Just a couple of tips, but overall a very nice image.</td>', 'The colours are really nicehere and there''s nice expression. I find the noise in the image a bit distracting (too many dots). Also, it may enhance a photo like this to have one main subject with other players in the background. Having one subject to focus the eye will allow the eye to move around to the other subjects and will add a bit more of a pleasing aspect to the photo. Think of your photo as divided by three horizontally and vertically, then think of how one subject can really hold attention in one of those nine spots/positions. The subject should ideally be a bit bigger than the others. Just a couple of tips, but overall a very nice image.', '2005-01-03 11:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088685, 132834, 10080, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. good framing, nice tonal range! 8</td>', 'Nice shot. good framing, nice tonal range! 8', '2005-01-03 12:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088696, 131136, 25754, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful, and the best I''ve seen in this challenge so far. Wonderful colours, DOF (would have been great for the Bokeh challenge too!), and a great candid moment. Good luck, I''m sure you''ll have a top finish!</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful, and the best I''ve seen in this challenge so far. Wonderful colours, DOF (would have been great for the Bokeh challenge too!), and a great candid moment. Good luck, I''m sure you''ll have a top finish!', '2005-01-03 12:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088712, 132191, 18485, '<td valign="top">would have prefered plain b/w instead of this odd yellow duotone.  in any case, the photo composition and mood are excellent.</td>', 'would have prefered plain b/w instead of this odd yellow duotone.  in any case, the photo composition and mood are excellent.', '2005-01-03 12:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088719, 132683, 25754, '<td valign="top">Really like this shot. It may have benefited from selective desat, where only the mirror reflection is in colour and the rest is in bw or other tone, only because the yellow is so overpowering. But that doesn''t keep me from voting this highly.</td>', 'Really like this shot. It may have benefited from selective desat, where only the mirror reflection is in colour and the rest is in bw or other tone, only because the yellow is so overpowering. But that doesn''t keep me from voting this highly.', '2005-01-03 12:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088808, 131521, 9932, '<td valign="top">Nice shot<br/>One thing I do notice is that the white hat, shirt and towel seem to be overexposed or overprocessed? Given that the white window frame seems to be ok I would guess overprocessed.</td>', 'Nice shotOne thing I do notice is that the white hat, shirt and towel seem to be overexposed or overprocessed? Given that the white window frame seems to be ok I would guess overprocessed.', '2005-01-03 13:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088815, 132007, 9932, '<td valign="top"><br/></td>', '', '2005-01-03 13:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088821, 132147, 9932, '<td valign="top">I like the shot but I feel it would have been better with a vertical composition, tighter framed and with less void space.</td>', 'I like the shot but I feel it would have been better with a vertical composition, tighter framed and with less void space.', '2005-01-03 14:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088825, 132871, 9932, '<td valign="top">I like thinking outside of the box but to me this is just to much "Portrait".<br/>But I will not hammer your score for what you submitted. Nice work.</td>', 'I like thinking outside of the box but to me this is just to much "Portrait".But I will not hammer your score for what you submitted. Nice work.', '2005-01-03 14:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088826, 131286, 3032, '<td valign="top">Is he afraid that they are going to steal his gun or do policemen always have their hand on their gun in your country? On the other hand, that dude in the middle looks like Axle Rose so you really can''t blame him. :)<br/> <br/>Great '' Authority'' pic too btw.</td>', 'Is he afraid that they are going to steal his gun or do policemen always have their hand on their gun in your country? On the other hand, that dude in the middle looks like Axle Rose so you really can''t blame him. :) Great '' Authority'' pic too btw.', '2005-01-03 14:05:37.000000', NULL, 1);
