(1088845, 132302, 9932, '<td valign="top">I bet you are getting hammered as bad as I am :)<br/>I like the shot but I think it could use some additional adjustments with curves and etc. I may have cropped out the poles also. Nice idea.</td>', 'I bet you are getting hammered as bad as I am :)I like the shot but I think it could use some additional adjustments with curves and etc. I may have cropped out the poles also. Nice idea.', '2005-01-03 14:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
