(1088858, 132106, 9932, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. It should go over very well with the challenge police :)</td>', 'Very nicely done. It should go over very well with the challenge police :)', '2005-01-03 14:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088881, 132368, 9932, '<td valign="top">I like this shot nicely done.<br/>I think the composition could have been better and the back of the bird seems to be blown away or overexposed. But still very nice idea.</td>', 'I like this shot nicely done.I think the composition could have been better and the back of the bird seems to be blown away or overexposed. But still very nice idea.', '2005-01-03 14:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088888, 132250, 9932, '<td valign="top">Nice work<br/>One thing I would say is that the composition is to tight. It feels to much like a portrait. But I will not hammer the vote for that reason. Maybe more background and surroundings would have given it a more candid feeling.</td>', 'Nice workOne thing I would say is that the composition is to tight. It feels to much like a portrait. But I will not hammer the vote for that reason. Maybe more background and surroundings would have given it a more candid feeling.', '2005-01-03 14:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
