(1088909, 132636, 9932, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like this shot.<br/>Though you are probably going to get hammered by the border police :)<br/>That will not affect my vote.</td>', 'Very nice, I like this shot.Though you are probably going to get hammered by the border police :)That will not affect my vote.', '2005-01-03 14:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
