(1088977, 132634, 31213, '<td valign="top">Excellent job.  I wouldn''t be nearly as impressed if he didn''t have the expression that he has on his face.  It seems so easy to win people''s hearts over with a cute kid.....but honestly, this is exposed and composed very nicely.  Love the colors.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Excellent job.  I wouldn''t be nearly as impressed if he didn''t have the expression that he has on his face.  It seems so easy to win people''s hearts over with a cute kid.....but honestly, this is exposed and composed very nicely.  Love the colors.  Keep up the good work.', '2005-01-03 15:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088978, 132284, 31213, '<td valign="top">Precious smile on this kid!  Pure joy in his eyes.  The shapes in the photo are very interesting.  I think the smooth curved angles compliment the emmotions that are evoked in the audience when they see this child.  Great job!</td>', 'Precious smile on this kid!  Pure joy in his eyes.  The shapes in the photo are very interesting.  I think the smooth curved angles compliment the emmotions that are evoked in the audience when they see this child.  Great job!', '2005-01-03 15:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
