(1089123, 131629, 22310, '<td valign="top">Good candid shot.  I like the texture of the hair and the expression.  However, you lost a point or two due to the  red color cast and soft focus.</td>', 'Good candid shot.  I like the texture of the hair and the expression.  However, you lost a point or two due to the  red color cast and soft focus.', '2005-01-03 16:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
