(1089543, 131379, 2553, '<td valign="top">Great shot, great duotoning.  It''s a shot that captures a candid moment, but leaves you with so many questions.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Great shot, great duotoning.  It''s a shot that captures a candid moment, but leaves you with so many questions.  Nicely done.', '2005-01-03 19:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1089547, 132636, 2553, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this shot.  Probably because it makes me think of people I know!   The black and white is the perfect choice.  This shot, like a few others in the challenge, actually leaves me with so many questions - wanting to know their "story".  Also, I just noticed the border - classic and understated it complements the photo well.</td>', 'I absolutely love this shot.  Probably because it makes me think of people I know!   The black and white is the perfect choice.  This shot, like a few others in the challenge, actually leaves me with so many questions - wanting to know their "story".  Also, I just noticed the border - classic and understated it complements the photo well.', '2005-01-03 19:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
