(1089554, 132119, 20941, '<td valign="top">very cute shot! Nice job of capturing the innocence of a child making friends.</td>', 'very cute shot! Nice job of capturing the innocence of a child making friends.', '2005-01-03 20:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1089557, 132605, 2553, '<td valign="top">I have to come right out and tell you that this is my lowest rated photo in the challenge.  The concept kind of leaves me cold.  The people look like they were cut out of another photo and "photoshopped" into this one; they look unnatural.  I REALLY don''t like the "treatment" or whatever you did to the rocks; they, too, look like they were "photoshopped in".   The composition seems very heavy on the bottom, and the photo is  cut straight across the middle by the water line - there is nothing going on in the top half, and WAY too much going on in the bottom half.  <br/> <br/>I am so sorry; I usually find something to like in every photo, but this is one that just has no appeal to me at all.</td>', 'I have to come right out and tell you that this is my lowest rated photo in the challenge.  The concept kind of leaves me cold.  The people look like they were cut out of another photo and "photoshopped" into this one; they look unnatural.  I REALLY don''t like the "treatment" or whatever you did to the rocks; they, too, look like they were "photoshopped in".   The composition seems very heavy on the bottom, and the photo is  cut straight across the middle by the water line - there is nothing going on in the top half, and WAY too much going on in the bottom half.   I am so sorry; I usually find something to like in every photo, but this is one that just has no appeal to me at all.', '2005-01-03 20:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1089558, 132567, 20941, '<td valign="top">Without looking at your title, my first thought was that business must be slow. Good Job of capturing that.</td>', 'Without looking at your title, my first thought was that business must be slow. Good Job of capturing that.', '2005-01-03 20:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1089559, 131537, 10080, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and exposure. 8</td>', 'Nice lines and exposure. 8', '2005-01-03 20:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
