(1089744, 131382, 31213, '<td valign="top">I dont really know why I like this as much as I do.  I''ve clicked on it several times, and there is something that draws me in.  One thing I know I like is the interesting point of view.  So many people take pictures from eye level and they often come out boring.  This is almost like an alien abduction!  I also enjoy the shapes of the brick and circle pattern on the ground.  Great job!</td>', 'I dont really know why I like this as much as I do.  I''ve clicked on it several times, and there is something that draws me in.  One thing I know I like is the interesting point of view.  So many people take pictures from eye level and they often come out boring.  This is almost like an alien abduction!  I also enjoy the shapes of the brick and circle pattern on the ground.  Great job!', '2005-01-03 21:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
