(1089753, 132724, 31213, '<td valign="top">That bums shoes looks awefully shiney....Nice capture.  Very interesting dive hes doing!  Good choice on making this black and white.  Think it would have lost a lot in color.</td>', 'That bums shoes looks awefully shiney....Nice capture.  Very interesting dive hes doing!  Good choice on making this black and white.  Think it would have lost a lot in color.', '2005-01-03 21:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1089760, 132832, 31213, '<td valign="top">Though I''m not a huge clown fan, I think this is a very genuine shot.  Her expression is definately real.  I wonder what that clown is doing thats so darn funny!?</td>', 'Though I''m not a huge clown fan, I think this is a very genuine shot.  Her expression is definately real.  I wonder what that clown is doing thats so darn funny!?', '2005-01-03 21:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
