(1090253, 131250, 30861, '<td valign="top">nicely composed, vibrant and vaguely disturbing.  The one face turned right, as allt he others face left, is excellent, and that this face is crowned with spikes makes it even better. If I have a problem here, though, it is that it seems like the "object" of this picture is the pointing at whatever''s happening off-frame to the left, and I''d think it would work better if the anomalous figure had a look of disgust or boredom, rather than the entirely neutral look he is wearing. Or is he a she?</td>', 'nicely composed, vibrant and vaguely disturbing.  The one face turned right, as allt he others face left, is excellent, and that this face is crowned with spikes makes it even better. If I have a problem here, though, it is that it seems like the "object" of this picture is the pointing at whatever''s happening off-frame to the left, and I''d think it would work better if the anomalous figure had a look of disgust or boredom, rather than the entirely neutral look he is wearing. Or is he a she?', '2005-01-04 06:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
