(1090648, 132799, 22479, '<td valign="top">Haha...this looks somewhat staged, but I don''t think it matters. It''s a great silhouette with a pleasing backdrop. Framed excellently. Focus is dead on. One of my top picks. 10</td>', 'Haha...this looks somewhat staged, but I don''t think it matters. It''s a great silhouette with a pleasing backdrop. Framed excellently. Focus is dead on. One of my top picks. 10', '2005-01-04 13:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
