(1090662, 132007, 22479, '<td valign="top">Perfect for this challenge. Mysterious, enigmatic, and disconcerting. Tells a story while maintaining utmost photographic integrity. Excellent tonal range. Focus and exposure, and DOF is excellent. The halo is subtle enough not to be distracting and is effective in drawing the gaze upwards. One of my top picks. 10</td>', 'Perfect for this challenge. Mysterious, enigmatic, and disconcerting. Tells a story while maintaining utmost photographic integrity. Excellent tonal range. Focus and exposure, and DOF is excellent. The halo is subtle enough not to be distracting and is effective in drawing the gaze upwards. One of my top picks. 10', '2005-01-04 13:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090685, 132734, 22479, '<td valign="top">Love the sky and the waves in this shot. Exposure is excellent in this shot...was probably quite difficult to preserve the dynamic range. The only suggestion I can make is to level the horizon with a fractional clockwise rotation. Still, not distracting enough to be a major issue. One of the best this round. 9</td>', 'Love the sky and the waves in this shot. Exposure is excellent in this shot...was probably quite difficult to preserve the dynamic range. The only suggestion I can make is to level the horizon with a fractional clockwise rotation. Still, not distracting enough to be a major issue. One of the best this round. 9', '2005-01-04 13:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090693, 131225, 22479, '<td valign="top">This is magnificent. Tonal range, exposure, focus, DOF is perfect. Loved the way you composed and framed the shot. Would be very surprised if this does not ribbon. 10</td>', 'This is magnificent. Tonal range, exposure, focus, DOF is perfect. Loved the way you composed and framed the shot. Would be very surprised if this does not ribbon. 10', '2005-01-04 13:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090698, 131379, 22479, '<td valign="top">Revisiting. Excellent exposure and tonal range. Very effective use of toning as well. Gives this that old nostalgic feel. This shot captures the essence of this challenge. Tells a story while maintaining photographic integrity. Bumping up. 8</td>', 'Revisiting. Excellent exposure and tonal range. Very effective use of toning as well. Gives this that old nostalgic feel. This shot captures the essence of this challenge. Tells a story while maintaining photographic integrity. Bumping up. 8', '2005-01-04 13:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090707, 131832, 13158, '<td valign="top">Oh too funny!  What a great capture!</td>', 'Oh too funny!  What a great capture!', '2005-01-04 13:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090717, 131094, 8860, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot - good backlighting, and fill flash. A touch more of the feet would have improved the comp, but focus is bang-on the eye.</td>', 'Sweet shot - good backlighting, and fill flash. A touch more of the feet would have improved the comp, but focus is bang-on the eye.', '2005-01-04 13:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090718, 132786, 22479, '<td valign="top">Revisiting. This is one of the rare photographs which fit the challege theme perfectly. I admire the expressions on the two figures: the one sitting does not make eye contact with the passerby as he sits rather dejectedly in the snow, while the well-to-do onlooker dismisses him with a curt wave of the hand as he rushes past.  Perfect!<br/> <br/>If you have some cropping real estate, I would recommend a slight clockwise rotation to level the wall on the left. Also, this appears to be straight B&amp;W, which is thoroughly effective. However, I wonder if a slight toning, say, sepia or steel blue, would add more depth. <br/> <br/>In any event, this is one of my favorites this round and I hope it performs well. 8</td>', 'Revisiting. This is one of the rare photographs which fit the challege theme perfectly. I admire the expressions on the two figures: the one sitting does not make eye contact with the passerby as he sits rather dejectedly in the snow, while the well-to-do onlooker dismisses him with a curt wave of the hand as he rushes past.  Perfect! If you have some cropping real estate, I would recommend a slight clockwise rotation to level the wall on the left. Also, this appears to be straight B&W, which is thoroughly effective. However, I wonder if a slight toning, say, sepia or steel blue, would add more depth.  In any event, this is one of my favorites this round and I hope it performs well. 8', '2005-01-04 13:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090722, 132899, 8860, '<td valign="top">A candid scene perhaps, but I don''t feel very involved in this. The field of view is too wide really, making the shot busy and disjointed. It needs context but the viewer can''t really establish whether this person is a drunk or a model placed there. Consequently it becomes weak due to the periphery in the shot being quite bland.</td>', 'A candid scene perhaps, but I don''t feel very involved in this. The field of view is too wide really, making the shot busy and disjointed. It needs context but the viewer can''t really establish whether this person is a drunk or a model placed there. Consequently it becomes weak due to the periphery in the shot being quite bland.', '2005-01-04 13:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090724, 132318, 8860, '<td valign="top">Vey much a posed shot for me - and this is a challenge after all. As such I feel it''s weak overall.<br/> <br/>The shot itself comes under ''snapshot'' for me but it''s clear and well focused if ultimately, a little dull.</td>', 'Vey much a posed shot for me - and this is a challenge after all. As such I feel it''s weak overall. The shot itself comes under ''snapshot'' for me but it''s clear and well focused if ultimately, a little dull.', '2005-01-04 13:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090729, 132862, 8860, '<td valign="top">Intriguing viewpoint and clearly candid. Mono helps the strength of the pattern in the shot, but I suppose the subject is just not that interesting for me to return to.</td>', 'Intriguing viewpoint and clearly candid. Mono helps the strength of the pattern in the shot, but I suppose the subject is just not that interesting for me to return to.', '2005-01-04 13:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090730, 132250, 22479, '<td valign="top">In a field of strong contenders, this amazing capture surfaces resoundingly as a forerunner for the ribbon. :-) What strikes me most about this image is the steel and brightness in her eyes, and that''s what makes a truly great portrait.<br/> <br/>Wonderful details, tonal range, DOF, framing and composition. 10<br/></td>', 'In a field of strong contenders, this amazing capture surfaces resoundingly as a forerunner for the ribbon. :-) What strikes me most about this image is the steel and brightness in her eyes, and that''s what makes a truly great portrait. Wonderful details, tonal range, DOF, framing and composition. 10', '2005-01-04 13:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090733, 132513, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good snap - you don''t see that everyday!  : )</td>', 'Good snap - you don''t see that everyday!  : )', '2005-01-04 13:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090735, 132636, 22479, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture, and perfect title. :-) I wish you had some cropping real estate to add some space to the top/left. Aside from that, simply wonderful. 9</td>', 'Amazing capture, and perfect title. :-) I wish you had some cropping real estate to add some space to the top/left. Aside from that, simply wonderful. 9', '2005-01-04 13:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090736, 131875, 26500, '<td valign="top">To me this photo has a real "snapshotish" feel to it because of what I assume is a flash pointed directly at the subject (cute btw).  Also the little white points in the costume or jacket distract from the face of your subject.  I don''t know if this is from in camera sharpening or post procesing.<br/> <br/>As far as the crop goes: I would have tried to cut out the rest of the toy, doll, whatever he is holding in his left hand as it is also a distracting element.<br/> <br/>As always this is IMO.<br/> <br/>Good luck too you.</td>', 'To me this photo has a real "snapshotish" feel to it because of what I assume is a flash pointed directly at the subject (cute btw).  Also the little white points in the costume or jacket distract from the face of your subject.  I don''t know if this is from in camera sharpening or post procesing. As far as the crop goes: I would have tried to cut out the rest of the toy, doll, whatever he is holding in his left hand as it is also a distracting element. As always this is IMO. Good luck too you.', '2005-01-04 13:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090738, 131927, 22479, '<td valign="top">Heartwarming moment, love the high key exposure. Just perfect. 10</td>', 'Heartwarming moment, love the high key exposure. Just perfect. 10', '2005-01-04 13:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090739, 132302, 26500, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve got the same "dosen''t meet the challenge" comment 50 times but I feel obligated to mention it because of how I scored this.<br/> <br/>Anyhow this is a lovely photo I just don''t see the connection to the challenge.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve got the same "dosen''t meet the challenge" comment 50 times but I feel obligated to mention it because of how I scored this. Anyhow this is a lovely photo I just don''t see the connection to the challenge. Good luck', '2005-01-04 13:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090740, 132873, 25232, '<td valign="top">Great comosition. I would have liked to see more of the mood or the personality of the subject, but i still think this is a very strong image.</td>', 'Great comosition. I would have liked to see more of the mood or the personality of the subject, but i still think this is a very strong image.', '2005-01-04 13:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090748, 131684, 22479, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W treatment was just perfect. Lovely DOF. His expression is sterotypical of a ref. Well done.</td>', 'B&W treatment was just perfect. Lovely DOF. His expression is sterotypical of a ref. Well done.', '2005-01-04 13:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090750, 132284, 22479, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus. Perefctly exposed, and with excellent tonal range. Lovely framing and composition.</td>', 'I like the soft focus. Perefctly exposed, and with excellent tonal range. Lovely framing and composition.', '2005-01-04 13:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090751, 131288, 22479, '<td valign="top">She appears to be in a rush, and I like the way her hair trails behind her, and I commend you for highlighting that aspect of this photograph. Well done.</td>', 'She appears to be in a rush, and I like the way her hair trails behind her, and I commend you for highlighting that aspect of this photograph. Well done.', '2005-01-04 13:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090756, 132740, 26500, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get what you were trying to convey with this photo.  The title seems to indicate something on the sales paper perhaps?  The boy who I am assuming is your subject and not the improvised mouseapad dosen''t really have an expression that emphasizes a mood of the moment.  At least not to me.<br/> <br/>Technical:<br/>The lighting is not the greatest because the important part of the photo (boy''s face) is shrouded in shadow.<br/> <br/>The focus also seems to be off as the whole picture is blurry.<br/> <br/>Crop: The subject''s head is cut off as well as part of the laptop.<br/> <br/>Composition: There is a lot of clutter in the shot from the book in the top right to the print on the "mouse pad" to the mouse cord.<br/> <br/>Overall this came across as a quickly taken snapshot.<br/> <br/>I don''t want to seem harsh but I felt I should justify the score given.</td>', 'I didn''t get what you were trying to convey with this photo.  The title seems to indicate something on the sales paper perhaps?  The boy who I am assuming is your subject and not the improvised mouseapad dosen''t really have an expression that emphasizes a mood of the moment.  At least not to me. Technical:The lighting is not the greatest because the important part of the photo (boy''s face) is shrouded in shadow. The focus also seems to be off as the whole picture is blurry. Crop: The subject''s head is cut off as well as part of the laptop. Composition: There is a lot of clutter in the shot from the book in the top right to the print on the "mouse pad" to the mouse cord. Overall this came across as a quickly taken snapshot. I don''t want to seem harsh but I felt I should justify the score given.', '2005-01-04 13:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090758, 132752, 22479, '<td valign="top">Precious expression on the kitties captured with perfect timing. The backdrop of snow complicates the exposure, but overall was handled well.</td>', 'Precious expression on the kitties captured with perfect timing. The backdrop of snow complicates the exposure, but overall was handled well.', '2005-01-04 13:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090761, 132821, 26500, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous photo however as I''m sure you''ve heard many times already.  I don''t see how it meets the challenge.<br/> <br/>I say the above in jest.<br/> <br/>I think you captured the mood of New Years perfectly and I like the out of the box thinking you did on this.<br/> <br/>I hope it does well.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous photo however as I''m sure you''ve heard many times already.  I don''t see how it meets the challenge. I say the above in jest. I think you captured the mood of New Years perfectly and I like the out of the box thinking you did on this. I hope it does well.', '2005-01-04 13:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090762, 131694, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent crop. Quite a dramatic sky which adds to the interest in this photograph. Some haloing around the foreground as a result of your exposure correction (perhaps by masking, or using the shadow&amp;highlights filter?) is distracting enough to be an in issue. Overall well done, though, and timing was perfect.</td>', 'Excellent crop. Quite a dramatic sky which adds to the interest in this photograph. Some haloing around the foreground as a result of your exposure correction (perhaps by masking, or using the shadow&highlights filter?) is distracting enough to be an in issue. Overall well done, though, and timing was perfect.', '2005-01-04 14:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090769, 131521, 22479, '<td valign="top">I like this composition. I think the figure in the foreground holds enough interest to float the boat so to speak. <br/> <br/>It appears that his shirt and hat was a bit overexposed, and the background is fairly dark, which seems to me like the lighting was rather difficult to work with. It''s a tough situation to be in, and overall I think you handled it fairly well. One other issue: appears to be miscropped evidenced by the lower right corner. But that''s not distracting enough to be a major issue. Well done.</td>', 'I like this composition. I think the figure in the foreground holds enough interest to float the boat so to speak.  It appears that his shirt and hat was a bit overexposed, and the background is fairly dark, which seems to me like the lighting was rather difficult to work with. It''s a tough situation to be in, and overall I think you handled it fairly well. One other issue: appears to be miscropped evidenced by the lower right corner. But that''s not distracting enough to be a major issue. Well done.', '2005-01-04 14:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090776, 132734, 29477, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed candid and use of framing (for both the surfer and the for the sun).  In my top 10 for this challenge...7.  Great image.</td>', 'Beautifully composed candid and use of framing (for both the surfer and the for the sun).  In my top 10 for this challenge...7.  Great image.', '2005-01-04 14:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090825, 132007, 29293, '<td valign="top">looks posed</td>', 'looks posed', '2005-01-04 14:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090827, 131727, 29293, '<td valign="top">love this</td>', 'love this', '2005-01-04 14:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090830, 131166, 29293, '<td valign="top">i like the way you removed tone except for the scarf</td>', 'i like the way you removed tone except for the scarf', '2005-01-04 14:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090832, 131927, 29293, '<td valign="top">lovely emotion</td>', 'lovely emotion', '2005-01-04 14:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090834, 132799, 29293, '<td valign="top">interesting but looks posed</td>', 'interesting but looks posed', '2005-01-04 14:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090836, 132257, 29293, '<td valign="top">this  is very cute!</td>', 'this  is very cute!', '2005-01-04 14:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090837, 132773, 29293, '<td valign="top">nice motion blur</td>', 'nice motion blur', '2005-01-04 14:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090838, 132513, 29293, '<td valign="top">nice panning</td>', 'nice panning', '2005-01-04 14:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090839, 131531, 29293, '<td valign="top">nice single focal point</td>', 'nice single focal point', '2005-01-04 14:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090841, 131694, 29293, '<td valign="top">love the color</td>', 'love the color', '2005-01-04 14:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090873, 131927, 15711, '<td valign="top">I just love this. It''s tight - it''s literally "in your face." The contrast is great and it captured a once in a lifetime moment.  SUPERB!</td>', 'I just love this. It''s tight - it''s literally "in your face." The contrast is great and it captured a once in a lifetime moment.  SUPERB!', '2005-01-04 15:28:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1090876, 132636, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love this! It isn''t posed and it is a great candid shot.  Nice contrast!</td>', 'Love this! It isn''t posed and it is a great candid shot.  Nice contrast!', '2005-01-04 15:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090877, 132746, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like that you captured the movement as the candles and donuts tumbled down. Good one!</td>', 'I like that you captured the movement as the candles and donuts tumbled down. Good one!', '2005-01-04 15:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090879, 132752, 15711, '<td valign="top">Darling shot. It''s hard to capture the "moment" with animals in motion and you did just that. Good one.</td>', 'Darling shot. It''s hard to capture the "moment" with animals in motion and you did just that. Good one.', '2005-01-04 15:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090919, 132692, 22479, '<td valign="top">Stunning capture of this statue. Excellent bokeh, wonderful framing.<br/> <br/>Interesting in that an inanimate object was captured and submitted for this challenge. Does it work? I''m not sure, but perhaps voters here will not be very forgiving. Best of luck.</td>', 'Stunning capture of this statue. Excellent bokeh, wonderful framing. Interesting in that an inanimate object was captured and submitted for this challenge. Does it work? I''m not sure, but perhaps voters here will not be very forgiving. Best of luck.', '2005-01-04 16:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090924, 131531, 22479, '<td valign="top">Motion blur adds an interesting dimension to this photograph in that it so effectively isolates the main subject. To me, it conveys the absorbance of focus to the conversation on the phone and the obliviousness to one''s surroundings oftentimes when engaged on the cell phone. Nice job in a photograph that effectively meets the challenge.</td>', 'Motion blur adds an interesting dimension to this photograph in that it so effectively isolates the main subject. To me, it conveys the absorbance of focus to the conversation on the phone and the obliviousness to one''s surroundings oftentimes when engaged on the cell phone. Nice job in a photograph that effectively meets the challenge.', '2005-01-04 16:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090928, 132873, 22479, '<td valign="top">Position within frame very effective in conveying the message within your title. B&amp;W treatment tastefully executed and nice DOF. I like the way your subject gazes away from the camera, as if lost. Nicely captured.</td>', 'Position within frame very effective in conveying the message within your title. B&W treatment tastefully executed and nice DOF. I like the way your subject gazes away from the camera, as if lost. Nicely captured.', '2005-01-04 16:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090931, 132794, 22479, '<td valign="top">Great entry for this challenge. The upward gaze and close crop highlights the children''s enthusiasm and sense of adventure and optimism in a favorite outdoor activity (hiking through the wooded trails). If the other child was looking away from the camera, this image would be even more effective. Overall a nice capture.</td>', 'Great entry for this challenge. The upward gaze and close crop highlights the children''s enthusiasm and sense of adventure and optimism in a favorite outdoor activity (hiking through the wooded trails). If the other child was looking away from the camera, this image would be even more effective. Overall a nice capture.', '2005-01-04 16:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090940, 132683, 22479, '<td valign="top">Quite a unique take on this challenge. Love the motion blur in sharp contrast with the figures in the side view mirror. The distinction is very effective, I think. With the oncoming motorcycle within the frame as well makes for great timing. <br/> <br/>I like your border and it complements the vehicle. Overall a nice capture.</td>', 'Quite a unique take on this challenge. Love the motion blur in sharp contrast with the figures in the side view mirror. The distinction is very effective, I think. With the oncoming motorcycle within the frame as well makes for great timing.  I like your border and it complements the vehicle. Overall a nice capture.', '2005-01-04 16:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090944, 132489, 19408, '<td valign="top">other eye would be nice to be in focus. nice hair action.</td>', 'other eye would be nice to be in focus. nice hair action.', '2005-01-04 16:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090946, 132492, 5286, '<td valign="top">the photoshop is showing at the edges of the hair.</td>', 'the photoshop is showing at the edges of the hair.', '2005-01-04 16:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090952, 131865, 22479, '<td valign="top">Selective desaturation choice works effectively here as your DOF was quite broad and thus the desat helps to isolate your main subject. This entry is particularly effective in meeting the challenge as there is an interesting story within as well as good overall photographic integrity. If anything, the overall exposure is a bit murky but in this setting works to enhance the flavor of the moment. Well done.</td>', 'Selective desaturation choice works effectively here as your DOF was quite broad and thus the desat helps to isolate your main subject. This entry is particularly effective in meeting the challenge as there is an interesting story within as well as good overall photographic integrity. If anything, the overall exposure is a bit murky but in this setting works to enhance the flavor of the moment. Well done.', '2005-01-04 16:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090956, 132191, 19408, '<td valign="top">nice. seems a little dark. his face especially. i''m unsure of the tilt.</td>', 'nice. seems a little dark. his face especially. i''m unsure of the tilt.', '2005-01-04 16:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090960, 131445, 30861, '<td valign="top">The post-processing to B/W in the surround is so evident here that it made the photo feel less candid to me. Incidentally, in doing such selective desaturation, pay carefull ateention to the transitions. sme grass to her left and udner the unbrella is still green, and this hurts.<br/> <br/>Even had this been all color or all B/W, it is less succesful than many as a candid to me because there''s no real emotional content; hands and faces carry most of the weight for that, and neither is evifdent in this image. This is a personal aesthetic bias; others may disagree.</td>', 'The post-processing to B/W in the surround is so evident here that it made the photo feel less candid to me. Incidentally, in doing such selective desaturation, pay carefull ateention to the transitions. sme grass to her left and udner the unbrella is still green, and this hurts. Even had this been all color or all B/W, it is less succesful than many as a candid to me because there''s no real emotional content; hands and faces carry most of the weight for that, and neither is evifdent in this image. This is a personal aesthetic bias; others may disagree.', '2005-01-04 16:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090963, 132405, 19408, '<td valign="top">the background and fore ground seems uninteresting. try framing to get some depth and more discriminating on the background. if the backgound is uninteresting perhaps blurring it with a large aperture would make it less distracting.</td>', 'the background and fore ground seems uninteresting. try framing to get some depth and more discriminating on the background. if the backgound is uninteresting perhaps blurring it with a large aperture would make it less distracting.', '2005-01-04 16:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090966, 132862, 30861, '<td valign="top">While this is an appealing image, in my mind it''s not truly a "candid" shot; more of an environmental shot. This is a personal aesthetic bias, not a reflection on the quality of your picture.</td>', 'While this is an appealing image, in my mind it''s not truly a "candid" shot; more of an environmental shot. This is a personal aesthetic bias, not a reflection on the quality of your picture.', '2005-01-04 16:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090967, 131712, 22479, '<td valign="top">Composed very well with the choice of framing and black backdrop. Timing just perfect with the chihuahua''s sloppy tongue in full extension. If I were to nitpick, I''d say that the midtones are a bit flat evidenced by the uniformity of tonal range on the subject''s face and hand. No big deal overall and still a great capture. Well done.</td>', 'Composed very well with the choice of framing and black backdrop. Timing just perfect with the chihuahua''s sloppy tongue in full extension. If I were to nitpick, I''d say that the midtones are a bit flat evidenced by the uniformity of tonal range on the subject''s face and hand. No big deal overall and still a great capture. Well done.', '2005-01-04 16:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090972, 132522, 30861, '<td valign="top">I have mixed feelings about this image. At some levels it works very well, but it''s ultimately not especially satisfying to me. The blurriness of the page turning is a plus, not a negative, incidentally.</td>', 'I have mixed feelings about this image. At some levels it works very well, but it''s ultimately not especially satisfying to me. The blurriness of the page turning is a plus, not a negative, incidentally.', '2005-01-04 16:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090973, 132692, 30861, '<td valign="top">For me, personally, this ismply is not a candid shot. Candid requires "life" to meet its goal. I fon''t think any photograph of an inanimate subject may be called candid.</td>', 'For me, personally, this ismply is not a candid shot. Candid requires "life" to meet its goal. I fon''t think any photograph of an inanimate subject may be called candid.', '2005-01-04 16:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090974, 132074, 22479, '<td valign="top">The sharp differential in saturation between the subject''s headgear and the rest of the image makes for a very surreal feel in this capture. I wish this man was in a different setting other than what appears to be a coarse concrete wall. It almost seems a composite of two pictures (the man and the wall) in the sense that you have so much fine detail within the feathers and the figure, but extremely coarse details on the wall which appears to be taken at a different focal length (zoomed in or shot closer to wall). Still a good capture and well presented.</td>', 'The sharp differential in saturation between the subject''s headgear and the rest of the image makes for a very surreal feel in this capture. I wish this man was in a different setting other than what appears to be a coarse concrete wall. It almost seems a composite of two pictures (the man and the wall) in the sense that you have so much fine detail within the feathers and the figure, but extremely coarse details on the wall which appears to be taken at a different focal length (zoomed in or shot closer to wall). Still a good capture and well presented.', '2005-01-04 16:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090975, 132224, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s a marvelous facial expression. I''d have scored this higher if it had a fuller tonal range and were not so static in composition.</td>', 'It''s a marvelous facial expression. I''d have scored this higher if it had a fuller tonal range and were not so static in composition.', '2005-01-04 16:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090976, 132302, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is not a "candid" by my definition, lacking any live subject.</td>', 'This is not a "candid" by my definition, lacking any live subject.', '2005-01-04 16:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090977, 132626, 22479, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Not sure if I would have the courage to attempt this shot. :-)<br/> <br/>I like the expression on his face and it adds a lot of interest to the composition.</td>', 'Great capture. Not sure if I would have the courage to attempt this shot. :-) I like the expression on his face and it adds a lot of interest to the composition.', '2005-01-04 16:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090980, 131671, 30861, '<td valign="top">In my personal view, this is less a candid than it is a sports/action photo. The action is good; if the technical details were better I''d have rated it a bit higher, but the subjects are hard to "read" properly. A selection mask and some levels adjustment on the 2 sailors would work wonders for this shot. San Francisco bay?</td>', 'In my personal view, this is less a candid than it is a sports/action photo. The action is good; if the technical details were better I''d have rated it a bit higher, but the subjects are hard to "read" properly. A selection mask and some levels adjustment on the 2 sailors would work wonders for this shot. San Francisco bay?', '2005-01-04 16:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090982, 132121, 22479, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft focus, and rich colors. Great framing with the prominent tree ornament within view.</td>', 'Lovely soft focus, and rich colors. Great framing with the prominent tree ornament within view.', '2005-01-04 16:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090985, 132896, 22479, '<td valign="top">The expression on his face appears to be sad, despirited, broken. The oblique rear view was a good choice in really presenting this unfortunate scene effectively. The appeal of this photograph for me is in the way you really nailed the moment. Nice.</td>', 'The expression on his face appears to be sad, despirited, broken. The oblique rear view was a good choice in really presenting this unfortunate scene effectively. The appeal of this photograph for me is in the way you really nailed the moment. Nice.', '2005-01-04 16:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090987, 132712, 22479, '<td valign="top">The desaturation treatment was tastefully executed and enhances the mist off the surface of the water. Nicely captured.</td>', 'The desaturation treatment was tastefully executed and enhances the mist off the surface of the water. Nicely captured.', '2005-01-04 16:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090991, 132862, 22479, '<td valign="top">I like the way you included the swirling design in the floor tile within your crop. The position of the onlookers gives a pleasing symmetry to the composition and I think you nailed this shot at the right moment. <br/> <br/>Particularly effective in meeting this challenge...dramatic and with a story to be told while adhering to photographic integrity. Well done.</td>', 'I like the way you included the swirling design in the floor tile within your crop. The position of the onlookers gives a pleasing symmetry to the composition and I think you nailed this shot at the right moment.  Particularly effective in meeting this challenge...dramatic and with a story to be told while adhering to photographic integrity. Well done.', '2005-01-04 16:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090993, 132720, 22479, '<td valign="top">He appears too aggressive and she appears too timid. I think the appeal of this photograph is in those facial expressions. Nicely captured.<br/> <br/>Colors could have been boosted a bit to enhances the skin tones and clothing. While I''m not a big fan of oversaturated colors, this one appears a bit flat.</td>', 'He appears too aggressive and she appears too timid. I think the appeal of this photograph is in those facial expressions. Nicely captured. Colors could have been boosted a bit to enhances the skin tones and clothing. While I''m not a big fan of oversaturated colors, this one appears a bit flat.', '2005-01-04 17:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091006, 132890, 22479, '<td valign="top">It appears you took care in your desaturation treatment of this image. There is a spot behind the woman that you missed however. I think the larger issue is your choice of desaturation. Does it enhance the message or overall feel you are trying to convey? Or is it merely an exercise for the sake of doing it? In any event, I feel that a better choice would have been to reverse the desaturation so that your subject becomes the highlight.</td>', 'It appears you took care in your desaturation treatment of this image. There is a spot behind the woman that you missed however. I think the larger issue is your choice of desaturation. Does it enhance the message or overall feel you are trying to convey? Or is it merely an exercise for the sake of doing it? In any event, I feel that a better choice would have been to reverse the desaturation so that your subject becomes the highlight.', '2005-01-04 17:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091024, 132007, 22011, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot, but given the camera position it can''t really be a candid, unless she''s blind.. :-).  6</td>', 'This is a neat shot, but given the camera position it can''t really be a candid, unless she''s blind.. :-).  6', '2005-01-04 17:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091075, 132007, 27375, '<td valign="top">Not voting but awesome shot, just love it.</td>', 'Not voting but awesome shot, just love it.', '2005-01-04 17:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091090, 131629, 2337, '<td valign="top">Beutifully done!  The sun is a bit harsh on the left side... But wonderful catch :)</td>', 'Beutifully done!  The sun is a bit harsh on the left side... But wonderful catch :)', '2005-01-04 17:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091110, 131965, 2337, '<td valign="top">This suffered from the size... You can have 640 pix on one side and up to 150k file size... This was very hard to view compared to the shots that used the allowable size.  Nice catch though :)</td>', 'This suffered from the size... You can have 640 pix on one side and up to 150k file size... This was very hard to view compared to the shots that used the allowable size.  Nice catch though :)', '2005-01-04 18:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091112, 132284, 27375, '<td valign="top">This kid looks familiar :)</td>', 'This kid looks familiar :)', '2005-01-04 18:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091113, 131832, 17126, '<td valign="top">HAHAHAHAHAHAHA</td>', 'HAHAHAHAHAHAHA', '2005-01-04 18:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091117, 132901, 2337, '<td valign="top">The line of the grill in the auto behind your subject seems to pierce her head... Also the shadow on her face is unfortunate in contrast to the sun on her hand...  But that''s just me, and what do I know? :)</td>', 'The line of the grill in the auto behind your subject seems to pierce her head... Also the shadow on her face is unfortunate in contrast to the sun on her hand...  But that''s just me, and what do I know? :)', '2005-01-04 18:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
