(1092275, 132890, 25347, '<td valign="top">Not really sure selective desat works here.  Usually, its used to draw your attention to the main subject by leaving it colored.  Instead, you''ve uncolored the main subject, thus dividing my interests.  My eyes keep going back and forth between the people and the colored foilage.  Probably would''ve looked better completely B&amp;W.  Though, that leaf thing near his bag sort of bothers me too.</td>', 'Not really sure selective desat works here.  Usually, its used to draw your attention to the main subject by leaving it colored.  Instead, you''ve uncolored the main subject, thus dividing my interests.  My eyes keep going back and forth between the people and the colored foilage.  Probably would''ve looked better completely B&W.  Though, that leaf thing near his bag sort of bothers me too.', '2005-01-05 06:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1092278, 132257, 25347, '<td valign="top">Aha!  See, there is a drawback to it being warm all year round!  I knew it!  Excellent framing... is this rgarciah?  The sky seems a little off colored... might wanna try a polarizing filter.</td>', 'Aha!  See, there is a drawback to it being warm all year round!  I knew it!  Excellent framing... is this rgarciah?  The sky seems a little off colored... might wanna try a polarizing filter.', '2005-01-05 06:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1092281, 132760, 25347, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, the dreadlocks throw off the theme of the rest of the shot, but I won''t hold that against you.  Well framed, I like how the neck bisects the image.  But I wish the top of the model''s head were in the frame.</td>', 'In my opinion, the dreadlocks throw off the theme of the rest of the shot, but I won''t hold that against you.  Well framed, I like how the neck bisects the image.  But I wish the top of the model''s head were in the frame.', '2005-01-05 06:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1092284, 132318, 25347, '<td valign="top">hint:  generally its better in a photograph not to show the inside of a person''s nose ; )  The shadow is pretty harsh.. If you could''ve, I would try bouncing the flash off of something or adding some fill lighting in the background.</td>', 'hint:  generally its better in a photograph not to show the inside of a person''s nose ; )  The shadow is pretty harsh.. If you could''ve, I would try bouncing the flash off of something or adding some fill lighting in the background.', '2005-01-05 06:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1092285, 131764, 25347, '<td valign="top">Yey!  Krogers!  You must be pretty close to me, I don''t think they''re a very big chain.  It would''ve been a cool effect had the box been level, but still well executed.  Love the lighting and the sharpness, the colors are right on.</td>', 'Yey!  Krogers!  You must be pretty close to me, I don''t think they''re a very big chain.  It would''ve been a cool effect had the box been level, but still well executed.  Love the lighting and the sharpness, the colors are right on.', '2005-01-05 06:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1092319, 132007, 16636, '<td valign="top">lovelly capyure, the camera angle is great and enhances the image, should do well good luck</td>', 'lovelly capyure, the camera angle is great and enhances the image, should do well good luck', '2005-01-05 07:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1092321, 132712, 16636, '<td valign="top">I like tyhe softness in your image and the pale colours seem to work very well - good luck</td>', 'I like tyhe softness in your image and the pale colours seem to work very well - good luck', '2005-01-05 07:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1092323, 132718, 16636, '<td valign="top">This is the top image for me in this challenge, a true candid. Very well done good luck - 10</td>', 'This is the top image for me in this challenge, a true candid. Very well done good luck - 10', '2005-01-05 07:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
