(1093432, 132643, 22310, '<td valign="top">Nice photo and very well cropped.  I like the darkness at the left it draws the eye to the subject (dodge / burn?).  However on my monitor it seems a little dark.  I would have rated it higher if the details weren''t lost in the black clothing.</td>', 'Nice photo and very well cropped.  I like the darkness at the left it draws the eye to the subject (dodge / burn?).  However on my monitor it seems a little dark.  I would have rated it higher if the details weren''t lost in the black clothing.', '2005-01-05 17:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093433, 131865, 22310, '<td valign="top">My favourite in this challege.  I especially like the selective destauration, it makes the subject "pop".</td>', 'My favourite in this challege.  I especially like the selective destauration, it makes the subject "pop".', '2005-01-05 17:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093438, 132669, 22310, '<td valign="top">Good picture.  You captured both the motion and the emotion of the moment.  However, to my eye (and my monitor) the reds are a little to saturated.</td>', 'Good picture.  You captured both the motion and the emotion of the moment.  However, to my eye (and my monitor) the reds are a little to saturated.', '2005-01-05 17:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093441, 132134, 22310, '<td valign="top">A beautiful picture.  The contrast is just right.  You do not loose any detail in highlights (the horse or snow) or the shadows.  The motion of the hand is a little distracting but overall great shot.</td>', 'A beautiful picture.  The contrast is just right.  You do not loose any detail in highlights (the horse or snow) or the shadows.  The motion of the hand is a little distracting but overall great shot.', '2005-01-05 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093445, 131764, 22310, '<td valign="top">I love the big blue eyes, light gradient across the face and the shallow DOF.  This may have been a little stronger if you reduced the brightness on the box lable with some dodging and or burning.</td>', 'I love the big blue eyes, light gradient across the face and the shallow DOF.  This may have been a little stronger if you reduced the brightness on the box lable with some dodging and or burning.', '2005-01-05 17:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093449, 131377, 22310, '<td valign="top">Very very nice.  I like the natural light and the texture on her face.  You were also able to keep both the highlights and the shadows in check in this high contrast shot.  I would have given it a little higher if the ear and red ball cap were not in the photo.  Nice shot though, 7.</td>', 'Very very nice.  I like the natural light and the texture on her face.  You were also able to keep both the highlights and the shadows in check in this high contrast shot.  I would have given it a little higher if the ear and red ball cap were not in the photo.  Nice shot though, 7.', '2005-01-05 17:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093452, 132718, 22310, '<td valign="top">Great B&amp;W!  You captured the moment perfectly.  I hope you do well, 8.</td>', 'Great B&W!  You captured the moment perfectly.  I hope you do well, 8.', '2005-01-05 17:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093458, 132121, 22310, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I like the natural light, narrow DOF and the framing.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I like the natural light, narrow DOF and the framing.', '2005-01-05 17:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093460, 131531, 22310, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the way you have isolated her and made her pop from the photo.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the way you have isolated her and made her pop from the photo.', '2005-01-05 17:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093471, 131865, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  With the tones you have it might have looked better in B&amp;W or another type of duotone.</td>', 'Nice image.  With the tones you have it might have looked better in B&W or another type of duotone.', '2005-01-05 17:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
