(1093508, 132636, 24494, '<td valign="top">i really see this in the top 5</td>', 'i really see this in the top 5', '2005-01-05 18:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093592, 132734, 27574, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo, with a great range of tones and values.  The darkness of the surfer and his board with the reflection really adds to the photo.  IMHO, If you did a few things to it it would really have punch....increase the saturation and contrast and adjust levels.  I copied it and also ran it through Neat Image and liked the results. The horizon line is crooked and it is too close to dead center for my tastes.  Still I love it and am giving it a high score.</td>', 'Fantastic photo, with a great range of tones and values.  The darkness of the surfer and his board with the reflection really adds to the photo.  IMHO, If you did a few things to it it would really have punch....increase the saturation and contrast and adjust levels.  I copied it and also ran it through Neat Image and liked the results. The horizon line is crooked and it is too close to dead center for my tastes.  Still I love it and am giving it a high score.', '2005-01-05 19:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093593, 132871, 27574, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rich tones and clarity....love it</td>', 'Beautiful rich tones and clarity....love it', '2005-01-05 19:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093594, 132780, 30845, '<td valign="top">Nice framing... the motion blur really brings attention to the tack sharp eyes... exposure is a touch hot--let your shadows be shadows, contrast = drama</td>', 'Nice framing... the motion blur really brings attention to the tack sharp eyes... exposure is a touch hot--let your shadows be shadows, contrast = drama', '2005-01-05 19:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093599, 132883, 30845, '<td valign="top">Nice moment caught mid-gesture... try to capture eye contact between subjects or from one to the other, it''s very engaging</td>', 'Nice moment caught mid-gesture... try to capture eye contact between subjects or from one to the other, it''s very engaging', '2005-01-05 19:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093605, 132840, 30845, '<td valign="top">Nice interplay of looks and expressions... less depth of field (larger aperture/smaller f-number) would de-emphasize the distracting background</td>', 'Nice interplay of looks and expressions... less depth of field (larger aperture/smaller f-number) would de-emphasize the distracting background', '2005-01-05 19:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093612, 132890, 30845, '<td valign="top">Nice moment, but the desaturation is gimmicky, although you might try this in a different photo because it makes them look like stone statues...  :)</td>', 'Nice moment, but the desaturation is gimmicky, although you might try this in a different photo because it makes them look like stone statues...  :)', '2005-01-05 19:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093615, 131713, 30845, '<td valign="top">Great expressions, but I''d prefer to either focus in on one or both of them, or show me what''s going on because the background is so non-descript</td>', 'Great expressions, but I''d prefer to either focus in on one or both of them, or show me what''s going on because the background is so non-descript', '2005-01-05 19:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093617, 132405, 30845, '<td valign="top">Great colors... need more depth, show the horizon or at least more of the background up the hill.  It wants to be a portrait but the subject is too small, and there''s not enough going on to make it an event, so at least put the subject in an interesting environment</td>', 'Great colors... need more depth, show the horizon or at least more of the background up the hill.  It wants to be a portrait but the subject is too small, and there''s not enough going on to make it an event, so at least put the subject in an interesting environment', '2005-01-05 19:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093620, 132119, 30845, '<td valign="top">Get closer!  There''s nothing going on in the background and you didn''t need to show the entire sculpture. In snapshot moments like this, first you get the shot right away for insurance, then you keep moving in to isolate the subject and what he''s doing for more impact and to convey the emotions.    :)</td>', 'Get closer!  There''s nothing going on in the background and you didn''t need to show the entire sculpture. In snapshot moments like this, first you get the shot right away for insurance, then you keep moving in to isolate the subject and what he''s doing for more impact and to convey the emotions.    :)', '2005-01-05 19:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093621, 131166, 30845, '<td valign="top">It''s fine without the colorization, esp. if you either zoom in or otherwise emphasize the subject, or, show more of the surroundings and his relationship with them.</td>', 'It''s fine without the colorization, esp. if you either zoom in or otherwise emphasize the subject, or, show more of the surroundings and his relationship with them.', '2005-01-05 19:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093629, 132643, 30845, '<td valign="top">Nice grab.  Try zooming out, using a wider angle or getting down on the ground to emphasize the isolation and the fact that you''re in stealth mode, or interpose some out-of-focus foreground element like foliage.</td>', 'Nice grab.  Try zooming out, using a wider angle or getting down on the ground to emphasize the isolation and the fact that you''re in stealth mode, or interpose some out-of-focus foreground element like foliage.', '2005-01-05 19:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093630, 131927, 30845, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition... contrast is harsh... let your shadows be shadows</td>', 'Very nice composition... contrast is harsh... let your shadows be shadows', '2005-01-05 19:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093635, 132714, 30845, '<td valign="top">Nice moment... did she ever interact with the duck more obviously?  Wait for the connection and show it.  Could also stand to see more environment without showing other people to maintain the isolation/aloneness.</td>', 'Nice moment... did she ever interact with the duck more obviously?  Wait for the connection and show it.  Could also stand to see more environment without showing other people to maintain the isolation/aloneness.', '2005-01-05 19:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093637, 132636, 30845, '<td valign="top">Nice candid action... bit contrasty</td>', 'Nice candid action... bit contrasty', '2005-01-05 19:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093639, 132760, 30845, '<td valign="top">Great mood and lighting on the face... album cover?  :)</td>', 'Great mood and lighting on the face... album cover?  :)', '2005-01-05 19:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093643, 132374, 30845, '<td valign="top">Great!</td>', 'Great!', '2005-01-05 19:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093647, 132284, 30845, '<td valign="top">Egg shape + baby = Wow</td>', 'Egg shape + baby = Wow', '2005-01-05 19:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093649, 132282, 30845, '<td valign="top">Nice family moment.  Get directly in front or at least show full length; don''t crop mid-thigh... need less depth of field or less distracting background--mom has antlers.  :)</td>', 'Nice family moment.  Get directly in front or at least show full length; don''t crop mid-thigh... need less depth of field or less distracting background--mom has antlers.  :)', '2005-01-05 19:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
