(1093654, 132543, 27574, '<td valign="top">It took me a minute...but I figured out that he is duck hunting and looking up through the duckblind for the ducks....Cute!</td>', 'It took me a minute...but I figured out that he is duck hunting and looking up through the duckblind for the ducks....Cute!', '2005-01-05 19:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093655, 132108, 30845, '<td valign="top">Any tourist can get this shot, so at the very least wait for a more interesting background, or focus on a specific element (e.g. hand under rifle in front of gate or door) or get an angle no one else is getting (e.g. from behind the guard).  Also, when capturing people walking take several exposures to ensure you don''t get an awkward foot position like this one.</td>', 'Any tourist can get this shot, so at the very least wait for a more interesting background, or focus on a specific element (e.g. hand under rifle in front of gate or door) or get an angle no one else is getting (e.g. from behind the guard).  Also, when capturing people walking take several exposures to ensure you don''t get an awkward foot position like this one.', '2005-01-05 19:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093656, 132718, 27574, '<td valign="top">Wonderful DOF and subject....love the look on the boys face....great capture</td>', 'Wonderful DOF and subject....love the look on the boys face....great capture', '2005-01-05 19:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093657, 131972, 25347, '<td valign="top">Why does this look suspiciously like the Oregon coast, at Cannon Beach? : )</td>', 'Why does this look suspiciously like the Oregon coast, at Cannon Beach? : )', '2005-01-05 19:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093658, 132901, 30845, '<td valign="top">Move so you don''t have a truck behind your subject.  Also, it''s more flattering to women if they turn their head towards the camera rather than looking straight ahead, so moving to the side has a double advantage.</td>', 'Move so you don''t have a truck behind your subject.  Also, it''s more flattering to women if they turn their head towards the camera rather than looking straight ahead, so moving to the side has a double advantage.', '2005-01-05 19:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093660, 132224, 27574, '<td valign="top">Beautifully rendered  B&amp;W and it certainly looks Candid</td>', 'Beautifully rendered  B&W and it certainly looks Candid', '2005-01-05 19:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093662, 131692, 30845, '<td valign="top">Nice mood... pay attention to cutting off fingers of the hand</td>', 'Nice mood... pay attention to cutting off fingers of the hand', '2005-01-05 19:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093664, 132342, 30845, '<td valign="top">This is simple, simple = good.  Watch your crop; mid-forearm is awkward... a shot like this without an interesting background needs depth and/or scale, i.e. need more background/environment.  At the very least, if the sky were richer/darker/more saturated (hint: polarizing filter) it would add drama</td>', 'This is simple, simple = good.  Watch your crop; mid-forearm is awkward... a shot like this without an interesting background needs depth and/or scale, i.e. need more background/environment.  At the very least, if the sky were richer/darker/more saturated (hint: polarizing filter) it would add drama', '2005-01-05 19:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093674, 132727, 30845, '<td valign="top">Nice grab... would rather see more ahead than behind because of the downward angle</td>', 'Nice grab... would rather see more ahead than behind because of the downward angle', '2005-01-05 19:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
