(1093981, 131705, 2, '<td valign="top">I love some sharp DOF, but this seems overly sharp to me, and it looks like you manually blurred to make that happen.  The people no longer look like they belong on the scene.  At least one suggestion to improve this would be to make the ground in focus at people''s distance, because it physically doesn''t make sense otherwise.</td>', 'I love some sharp DOF, but this seems overly sharp to me, and it looks like you manually blurred to make that happen.  The people no longer look like they belong on the scene.  At least one suggestion to improve this would be to make the ground in focus at people''s distance, because it physically doesn''t make sense otherwise.', '2005-01-05 22:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
