(1093994, 132669, 25742, '<td valign="top">the crop is maybe a tad too tight, kinda works against the motion in the subject by freezing it into a small frame. Very nice tho. Let''s see, at least a 7, maybe I upgrade late if this is the best of the crop. Good luck</td>', 'the crop is maybe a tad too tight, kinda works against the motion in the subject by freezing it into a small frame. Very nice tho. Let''s see, at least a 7, maybe I upgrade late if this is the best of the crop. Good luck', '2005-01-05 22:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
