(1094494, 131288, 10985, '<td valign="top">Great!</td>', 'Great!', '2005-01-06 10:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094495, 131380, 10985, '<td valign="top">And no peeping!</td>', 'And no peeping!', '2005-01-06 10:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094496, 132115, 10985, '<td valign="top">Great light on the model''s face. Calm image. I like it.</td>', 'Great light on the model''s face. Calm image. I like it.', '2005-01-06 10:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094498, 132752, 10985, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2005-01-06 10:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094500, 132695, 10985, '<td valign="top">Very good light and contrast. Cool candid!</td>', 'Very good light and contrast. Cool candid!', '2005-01-06 10:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094502, 131927, 10985, '<td valign="top">Tender and sweet. Excellent contrasts almost in the whole image. The boy''s left eye and cheek looks a bit too white.</td>', 'Tender and sweet. Excellent contrasts almost in the whole image. The boy''s left eye and cheek looks a bit too white.', '2005-01-06 10:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094552, 131529, 2741, '<td valign="top">This is exactly what I feel a candid is supposed to be.Black and white works great, and the backround sets the tone of the message. Good job.</td>', 'This is exactly what I feel a candid is supposed to be.Black and white works great, and the backround sets the tone of the message. Good job.', '2005-01-06 10:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094591, 131136, 24890, '<td valign="top">I absolutely adore this picture. This is timeless and deserving of a win. I give you a 10.<br/> <br/>PS... Did you think to maybe try it in black and white as well. Don''t get me wrong...I love the color so you can see the pink in the newborn''s skin... But black and whites are very classy and it might be nice to have this in color AND black and white.<br/> <br/>Way to go!</td>', 'I absolutely adore this picture. This is timeless and deserving of a win. I give you a 10. PS... Did you think to maybe try it in black and white as well. Don''t get me wrong...I love the color so you can see the pink in the newborn''s skin... But black and whites are very classy and it might be nice to have this in color AND black and white. Way to go!', '2005-01-06 11:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094790, 132862, 29269, '<td valign="top">The rail in the lower left draws too much attention. I think that the composition would have been better if you cropped it out, and preferably, if you''d taken a different standpoint.</td>', 'The rail in the lower left draws too much attention. I think that the composition would have been better if you cropped it out, and preferably, if you''d taken a different standpoint.', '2005-01-06 14:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095004, 131832, 11270, '<td valign="top">I am not able to vote, but this is a great photograph, it made me laugh. It''s good to laugh...do hope it makes it to the top 10, or even a ribbon......well done</td>', 'I am not able to vote, but this is a great photograph, it made me laugh. It''s good to laugh...do hope it makes it to the top 10, or even a ribbon......well done', '2005-01-06 18:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095026, 131378, 28141, '<td valign="top">Focus is too soft, but I like the background and color.</td>', 'Focus is too soft, but I like the background and color.', '2005-01-06 18:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095027, 132002, 28141, '<td valign="top">Cute picture, but the border is distracting.</td>', 'Cute picture, but the border is distracting.', '2005-01-06 18:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095053, 132696, 8860, '<td valign="top">Simple, effective, everyday observation shot. A contemplative vibe, marred only a little by the overt blurring which Ifeel is a bit heavy-handed.<br/> <br/>I have a feeling that the composition may have been stronger if the subjects were right of the frame, with more space to the left adding strength to daydream like gaze of the person on the right.</td>', 'Simple, effective, everyday observation shot. A contemplative vibe, marred only a little by the overt blurring which Ifeel is a bit heavy-handed. I have a feeling that the composition may have been stronger if the subjects were right of the frame, with more space to the left adding strength to daydream like gaze of the person on the right.', '2005-01-06 19:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095056, 132727, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice little pic of a familiar moment for me! (The carrier not the carried)<br/> <br/>The angle is a bit bland though (eye-level) and the centering, while not a flaw in itself, does not aid the  comp. in landsacpe format. I can''t help feeling that a portait arrangement may have worlked better, showing more of the way ahead. Exposure is a touch harsh.</td>', 'Nice little pic of a familiar moment for me! (The carrier not the carried) The angle is a bit bland though (eye-level) and the centering, while not a flaw in itself, does not aid the  comp. in landsacpe format. I can''t help feeling that a portait arrangement may have worlked better, showing more of the way ahead. Exposure is a touch harsh.', '2005-01-06 19:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095060, 132786, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great capture of a moment played out everywhere. His tired resignation is clear and the contrast of lifestyles apparent in the person''s clean dress and confident walk. Weather also helps the desolate vibe with a strong POV and choice of shallow DOF. Excellent stuff.</td>', 'Great capture of a moment played out everywhere. His tired resignation is clear and the contrast of lifestyles apparent in the person''s clean dress and confident walk. Weather also helps the desolate vibe with a strong POV and choice of shallow DOF. Excellent stuff.', '2005-01-06 19:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095062, 132345, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice feeling of being on the outside. I''d like to have seen his feet to emphasise the detachment. Clean and almost over-crisp (NeatImage?).</td>', 'Nice feeling of being on the outside. I''d like to have seen his feet to emphasise the detachment. Clean and almost over-crisp (NeatImage?).', '2005-01-06 19:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095070, 132191, 8860, '<td valign="top">Real shame about the tilt here, because this has great charm and character. Looks like an old French B-movie. You''d score much higher if you''d managed to notice this quite major flaw.</td>', 'Real shame about the tilt here, because this has great charm and character. Looks like an old French B-movie. You''d score much higher if you''d managed to notice this quite major flaw.', '2005-01-06 19:40:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1095074, 132720, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. You captured the emotion really well. A little boost in contrast would strengthen the photo technically. Well done. 8</td>', 'Nice shot. You captured the emotion really well. A little boost in contrast would strengthen the photo technically. Well done. 8', '2005-01-06 19:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095082, 131648, 8860, '<td valign="top">Now isn''t that one of the best songs and bands ever?<br/> <br/>Nice study too - matching the title nicely.</td>', 'Now isn''t that one of the best songs and bands ever? Nice study too - matching the title nicely.', '2005-01-06 19:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095098, 131648, 30605, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, composition. And I love this Pink Floyd line you choose for title.</td>', 'Very nice picture, composition. And I love this Pink Floyd line you choose for title.', '2005-01-06 20:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095101, 132888, 10818, '<td valign="top">Woderful photo that is truly candid and very sweet.  Great shot.</td>', 'Woderful photo that is truly candid and very sweet.  Great shot.', '2005-01-06 20:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095105, 131250, 10818, '<td valign="top">Great street shot with quite an interesting cast of charicters.</td>', 'Great street shot with quite an interesting cast of charicters.', '2005-01-06 20:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095108, 131521, 31213, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  Wish you had left a majority of the space in the frame in front of him though.  Usually if a subject is looking in a certain direction, its photographically correct to leave space in the frame on whichever way they are looking so that it doesnt seem cramped.  Nice shot though.</td>', 'Love this shot.  Wish you had left a majority of the space in the frame in front of him though.  Usually if a subject is looking in a certain direction, its photographically correct to leave space in the frame on whichever way they are looking so that it doesnt seem cramped.  Nice shot though.', '2005-01-06 20:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095112, 132636, 10818, '<td valign="top">Fabulous photo.  Super job of capturing the emotion of the man, it really makes the shot.  Cute pup too !</td>', 'Fabulous photo.  Super job of capturing the emotion of the man, it really makes the shot.  Cute pup too !', '2005-01-06 20:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095114, 132854, 31213, '<td valign="top">This picture is visualy complicated.  I think it would have been more effective with a different crop...your subjects get lost in the confusion.</td>', 'This picture is visualy complicated.  I think it would have been more effective with a different crop...your subjects get lost in the confusion.', '2005-01-06 20:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095116, 131576, 31213, '<td valign="top">Cool sky, nice horizon line, and the placement of your subjects is good.  But for this "candid" challenge its nice to see the subjects better.  Artistically, this shot is great.  For this challenge, maybe not so much.  We can''t tell what they are doing, their emotions, where they are, or whats going on.  Nice shot though.</td>', 'Cool sky, nice horizon line, and the placement of your subjects is good.  But for this "candid" challenge its nice to see the subjects better.  Artistically, this shot is great.  For this challenge, maybe not so much.  We can''t tell what they are doing, their emotions, where they are, or whats going on.  Nice shot though.', '2005-01-06 20:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095117, 132211, 31213, '<td valign="top">Where''s your subject?  If there was someone sitting or standing on the right side of this shot it would have been excellent.  Without that, it''s not very candid.</td>', 'Where''s your subject?  If there was someone sitting or standing on the right side of this shot it would have been excellent.  Without that, it''s not very candid.', '2005-01-06 20:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095122, 132374, 31213, '<td valign="top">Love the colors!  I also like his eyes...they are very expressive and say alot about the picture.</td>', 'Love the colors!  I also like his eyes...they are very expressive and say alot about the picture.', '2005-01-06 20:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095124, 132527, 31213, '<td valign="top">This picture cracks me up everytime I look at it!  LOL.</td>', 'This picture cracks me up everytime I look at it!  LOL.', '2005-01-06 20:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095127, 132191, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture!  Like the tones you brought out in post.  Is he drinking sake?  Great job.</td>', 'Very nice capture!  Like the tones you brought out in post.  Is he drinking sake?  Great job.', '2005-01-06 20:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095128, 132492, 31213, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  I think its a little too soft and obviously feathered around the edge of her head and body.  Otherwise, nice picture.</td>', 'Nice picture.  I think its a little too soft and obviously feathered around the edge of her head and body.  Otherwise, nice picture.', '2005-01-06 20:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095130, 132302, 31213, '<td valign="top">How is this candid?  You need a subject!</td>', 'How is this candid?  You need a subject!', '2005-01-06 20:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095143, 131288, 326, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! I love to tone and shadows... Good job!</td>', 'Nice shot! I love to tone and shadows... Good job!', '2005-01-06 20:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095157, 132683, 326, '<td valign="top">What an interesting image... I really like this. Good job!</td>', 'What an interesting image... I really like this. Good job!', '2005-01-06 20:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095242, 132752, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/> <br/>This is truly candid for these guys do not follow instructions. lol <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'returning for comments: This is truly candid for these guys do not follow instructions. lol   ', '2005-01-06 21:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095243, 131452, 29226, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, it captures the moment and your attention.</td>', 'I like this photo, it captures the moment and your attention.', '2005-01-06 21:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095267, 131379, 326, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful image! Great job!</td>', 'What a wonderful image! Great job!', '2005-01-06 22:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095291, 132824, 17507, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if you just saw this guy like this, but it looks posed, which I think doesn''t help.</td>', 'Don''t know if you just saw this guy like this, but it looks posed, which I think doesn''t help.', '2005-01-06 22:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095365, 132626, 31202, '<td valign="top">1</td>', '1', '2005-01-06 23:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095371, 132521, 18799, '<td valign="top">The desat really doesn''t work here, IMO</td>', 'The desat really doesn''t work here, IMO', '2005-01-06 23:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095373, 132740, 18799, '<td valign="top">In almost all cases, lack of focus will result in poor scores.</td>', 'In almost all cases, lack of focus will result in poor scores.', '2005-01-06 23:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095375, 132147, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think cropping could have been better.  There is too much information on the sides that distract from the subject.</td>', 'I think cropping could have been better.  There is too much information on the sides that distract from the subject.', '2005-01-06 23:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095376, 132886, 18799, '<td valign="top">While it''s candid for sure, there doesn''t seem to be any point to the photo.  Your title attempts to give it focus, but it''s not enough, IMO</td>', 'While it''s candid for sure, there doesn''t seem to be any point to the photo.  Your title attempts to give it focus, but it''s not enough, IMO', '2005-01-06 23:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095379, 131189, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like the abstractness of the blurred images and the tension between them and dthe sharp subject.   Good job</td>', 'I like the abstractness of the blurred images and the tension between them and dthe sharp subject.   Good job', '2005-01-06 23:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095384, 132871, 18799, '<td valign="top">While this is a really nice photo, I don''t get the feeling that it''s candid.  The child in the green appears to be posing for the camera.</td>', 'While this is a really nice photo, I don''t get the feeling that it''s candid.  The child in the green appears to be posing for the camera.', '2005-01-06 23:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095386, 132318, 18799, '<td valign="top">Looking up someones nose isn''t very appealing</td>', 'Looking up someones nose isn''t very appealing', '2005-01-06 23:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095451, 132374, 18799, '<td valign="top">This is just a fabulous capture.   One of my two 10''s</td>', 'This is just a fabulous capture.   One of my two 10''s', '2005-01-07 01:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095454, 132893, 18799, '<td valign="top">Very nice effects.  I hope you don''t get voted down by the "not in focus" crowd.  9</td>', 'Very nice effects.  I hope you don''t get voted down by the "not in focus" crowd.  9', '2005-01-07 01:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095456, 131692, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think this is great.  My only nit is that on my calibrated monitor, it has a slight blue tint.  Not penalizing you though.   9</td>', 'I think this is great.  My only nit is that on my calibrated monitor, it has a slight blue tint.  Not penalizing you though.   9', '2005-01-07 01:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095458, 132431, 18799, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments.  The expressions you captured are terrific, I am bumping from 8 to 9</td>', 'Returning for comments.  The expressions you captured are terrific, I am bumping from 8 to 9', '2005-01-07 01:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095460, 131238, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think this is a terrific photo.  I hope you don''t get voted down by the "not in focus" crowd.  8</td>', 'I think this is a terrific photo.  I hope you don''t get voted down by the "not in focus" crowd.  8', '2005-01-07 01:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095464, 131965, 18799, '<td valign="top">This is pretty small, and I''m sure you''ve heard that a lot by now.  Other than that, it doesn''t look very candid to me as they obviously know the camera is there.</td>', 'This is pretty small, and I''m sure you''ve heard that a lot by now.  Other than that, it doesn''t look very candid to me as they obviously know the camera is there.', '2005-01-07 01:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095468, 132119, 18799, '<td valign="top">Wonderful emotive image.  If anything, I would crop a little more from the left, but that''s just one opinion.   8</td>', 'Wonderful emotive image.  If anything, I would crop a little more from the left, but that''s just one opinion.   8', '2005-01-07 01:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095469, 132284, 18799, '<td valign="top">I love this.  For some reason, I look at this a a 50''s look comes to mind.  The black and white conversion is good, just the right contrast.   I think it could be just a little sharper in the face.  8</td>', 'I love this.  For some reason, I look at this a a 50''s look comes to mind.  The black and white conversion is good, just the right contrast.   I think it could be just a little sharper in the face.  8', '2005-01-07 01:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095470, 132669, 18799, '<td valign="top">Great timing.  I can feel the fun through the image. 8</td>', 'Great timing.  I can feel the fun through the image. 8', '2005-01-07 01:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095471, 132375, 18799, '<td valign="top">This is a good image technically, but emotively, it doesn''t really do it for me.   5</td>', 'This is a good image technically, but emotively, it doesn''t really do it for me.   5', '2005-01-07 01:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095472, 132302, 18799, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, candid has to have living subjects in it.</td>', 'In my opinion, candid has to have living subjects in it.', '2005-01-07 01:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095474, 131288, 30313, '<td valign="top">I really like the shadows and the framing of the photo.  I like the frameless glasses and long loop ear-rings.<br/>Unfortunately, I also see some aliasing artifacts in a few strands of hair.  Is it in the original "negative" or was it created by the posting process?  (This is my first posts, so forgive my ignorance in the matter...)</td>', 'I really like the shadows and the framing of the photo.  I like the frameless glasses and long loop ear-rings.Unfortunately, I also see some aliasing artifacts in a few strands of hair.  Is it in the original "negative" or was it created by the posting process?  (This is my first posts, so forgive my ignorance in the matter...)', '2005-01-07 01:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095477, 132627, 30313, '<td valign="top">This is great!  I love the contrast of the world speeding by (in an impressionistic way) versus the stillness of the couch, plants, and the restfulness of the the five people sitting on the couch.</td>', 'This is great!  I love the contrast of the world speeding by (in an impressionistic way) versus the stillness of the couch, plants, and the restfulness of the the five people sitting on the couch.', '2005-01-07 02:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095482, 132634, 30313, '<td valign="top">It''s sure hard to get a good candid shot, but this is great.  The background is nicely out of focus, giving emphasis to the boy.  The expression on the boy''s face is wonderful.  The angle of the umbrella adds so much to the composition.</td>', 'It''s sure hard to get a good candid shot, but this is great.  The background is nicely out of focus, giving emphasis to the boy.  The expression on the boy''s face is wonderful.  The angle of the umbrella adds so much to the composition.', '2005-01-07 02:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095485, 132734, 30313, '<td valign="top">Classic shot!</td>', 'Classic shot!', '2005-01-07 02:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095488, 131832, 30313, '<td valign="top">Great nature shot.</td>', 'Great nature shot.', '2005-01-07 02:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095489, 132873, 30313, '<td valign="top">Nice use of short depth of field.  Nice use of black and white.  I like folds in the coat.</td>', 'Nice use of short depth of field.  Nice use of black and white.  I like folds in the coat.', '2005-01-07 02:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095490, 132284, 30313, '<td valign="top">Nice expression on the child''s face.  Great framing.  Great background.  Good use of focus and depth of field.</td>', 'Nice expression on the child''s face.  Great framing.  Great background.  Good use of focus and depth of field.', '2005-01-07 02:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095584, 132799, 17047, '<td valign="top">That out of focus lamppost in the background is very distracting. Good idea though.</td>', 'That out of focus lamppost in the background is very distracting. Good idea though.', '2005-01-07 06:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095585, 131684, 17047, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t see the whistle at first and thought it was spit coming out his mouth.  A touch more detail in the shadows would give just a little more depth and make his whistle more obvious. Good though :)</td>', 'I couldn''t see the whistle at first and thought it was spit coming out his mouth.  A touch more detail in the shadows would give just a little more depth and make his whistle more obvious. Good though :)', '2005-01-07 06:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095588, 131225, 17047, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! Love the slight sepia tone as well. It really enhances the mood of the image.</td>', 'Gorgeous! Love the slight sepia tone as well. It really enhances the mood of the image.', '2005-01-07 06:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095719, 131288, 25059, '<td valign="top">excellent- different!</td>', 'excellent- different!', '2005-01-07 10:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095728, 132890, 15982, '<td valign="top">I just feel like the intergrity of the photo was lost here - this is more digital art than photography, in my opinion.</td>', 'I just feel like the intergrity of the photo was lost here - this is more digital art than photography, in my opinion.', '2005-01-07 11:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095730, 131629, 15982, '<td valign="top">this seems more like a portrait than a candid</td>', 'this seems more like a portrait than a candid', '2005-01-07 11:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095850, 131727, 22734, '<td valign="top">Funny and very well put together. My only minor complaint is the greenish skin tones, yet this is not a total distractor.</td>', 'Funny and very well put together. My only minor complaint is the greenish skin tones, yet this is not a total distractor.', '2005-01-07 13:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095997, 131965, 18197, '<td valign="top">I believe if you''ll post bigger photos, they will score better.</td>', 'I believe if you''ll post bigger photos, they will score better.', '2005-01-07 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096045, 131570, 17507, '<td valign="top">I really like the grain in this one. It gives a sense of agedness, which is perfect for the mood and title.</td>', 'I really like the grain in this one. It gives a sense of agedness, which is perfect for the mood and title.', '2005-01-07 15:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096047, 132849, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. It''s funny how similar their expressions are ;)</td>', 'Nice capture. It''s funny how similar their expressions are ;)', '2005-01-07 15:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096059, 132821, 18197, '<td valign="top">It may be that you won''t agree with me, but in my mind "candid" implies a photograph of a person at a candid (i.e. unaware of the camera) moment. So, to that way of thinking, this doesn''t really meet the challenge. Very nice photo however. Lots of action. Nice lighting. Good contrast between dark sky and lights and fireworks.</td>', 'It may be that you won''t agree with me, but in my mind "candid" implies a photograph of a person at a candid (i.e. unaware of the camera) moment. So, to that way of thinking, this doesn''t really meet the challenge. Very nice photo however. Lots of action. Nice lighting. Good contrast between dark sky and lights and fireworks.', '2005-01-07 15:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096060, 132752, 18197, '<td valign="top">It may be that you won''t agree with me, but in my mind "candid" implies a photograph of a person at a candid (i.e. unaware of the camera) moment. So, to that way of thinking, this doesn''t really meet the challenge. That being said, I like the photo and the interaction of the cats.</td>', 'It may be that you won''t agree with me, but in my mind "candid" implies a photograph of a person at a candid (i.e. unaware of the camera) moment. So, to that way of thinking, this doesn''t really meet the challenge. That being said, I like the photo and the interaction of the cats.', '2005-01-07 15:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096061, 131094, 18197, '<td valign="top">It may be that you won''t agree with me, but in my mind "candid" implies a photograph of a person at a candid (i.e. unaware of the camera) moment. So, to that way of thinking, this doesn''t really meet the challenge.</td>', 'It may be that you won''t agree with me, but in my mind "candid" implies a photograph of a person at a candid (i.e. unaware of the camera) moment. So, to that way of thinking, this doesn''t really meet the challenge.', '2005-01-07 15:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096062, 131380, 18197, '<td valign="top">It may be that you won''t agree with me, but in my mind "candid" implies a photograph of a person at a candid (i.e. unaware of the camera) moment. So, to that way of thinking, this doesn''t really meet the challenge. That being said, there is a lot to like about the photo, especially from the horizontal midline up.</td>', 'It may be that you won''t agree with me, but in my mind "candid" implies a photograph of a person at a candid (i.e. unaware of the camera) moment. So, to that way of thinking, this doesn''t really meet the challenge. That being said, there is a lot to like about the photo, especially from the horizontal midline up.', '2005-01-07 15:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
