(1096078, 132799, 18197, '<td valign="top">Please, don''t.</td>', 'Please, don''t.', '2005-01-07 15:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096088, 132250, 18197, '<td valign="top">It may be that you won''t agree with me, but in my mind "candid" implies a photograph of a person at a candid (i.e. unaware of the camera) moment. So, to that way of thinking, this doesn''t really meet the challenge.<br/> <br/>This is such a great photo. though, that I''ll assume it was taken with a really long lens and that the subject really wasn''t aware. Great character in the face. Perfectly lit. Nicely framed. Very appealing in its white point / black point balance. Focus is dead on. In short a perfect photo ... except for the challenge theme thing.</td>', 'It may be that you won''t agree with me, but in my mind "candid" implies a photograph of a person at a candid (i.e. unaware of the camera) moment. So, to that way of thinking, this doesn''t really meet the challenge. This is such a great photo. though, that I''ll assume it was taken with a really long lens and that the subject really wasn''t aware. Great character in the face. Perfectly lit. Nicely framed. Very appealing in its white point / black point balance. Focus is dead on. In short a perfect photo ... except for the challenge theme thing.', '2005-01-07 15:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096098, 131694, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo full of action. Absolutely terrific composition. Vibrant colors. Beautifully stopped motion. Really a very worthy effort. But without the feel of a candid photo of someone unaware of the camera.</td>', 'Very nice photo full of action. Absolutely terrific composition. Vibrant colors. Beautifully stopped motion. Really a very worthy effort. But without the feel of a candid photo of someone unaware of the camera.', '2005-01-07 15:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096102, 131379, 18197, '<td valign="top">Simply outstanding! A few focus issues but not very noticable. Looks like a ribbon winner to me.</td>', 'Simply outstanding! A few focus issues but not very noticable. Looks like a ribbon winner to me.', '2005-01-07 15:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096105, 132627, 18197, '<td valign="top">I cannot fully explain why I like this so much. Partly it''s the color I think. Partly it''s about the action swirling around the fixed subject. Partly it''s that it''s perfectly titled. Just a very pleasing image. Thanks.</td>', 'I cannot fully explain why I like this so much. Partly it''s the color I think. Partly it''s about the action swirling around the fixed subject. Partly it''s that it''s perfectly titled. Just a very pleasing image. Thanks.', '2005-01-07 16:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096119, 132284, 18197, '<td valign="top">I hope this does well in the voting because it is a wonderful photo. Technically, I love the composition, focus, DOF, levels and the lighting (although the background portholes distract a little. But more than that, I really like the emotion you''ve captured (mostly in the face and eyes) of playing a game that''s FUN! Very well done. Hope it ribbons.</td>', 'I hope this does well in the voting because it is a wonderful photo. Technically, I love the composition, focus, DOF, levels and the lighting (although the background portholes distract a little. But more than that, I really like the emotion you''ve captured (mostly in the face and eyes) of playing a game that''s FUN! Very well done. Hope it ribbons.', '2005-01-07 16:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096230, 132200, 18197, '<td valign="top">If you think of degree of difficulty, this is a pretty hard photo to get right. There are focus issues &amp; lighting issues that come from the venue. It looks like you may not have used a tripod which would have helped. And in the end, I just don''t get candid from this.</td>', 'If you think of degree of difficulty, this is a pretty hard photo to get right. There are focus issues & lighting issues that come from the venue. It looks like you may not have used a tripod which would have helped. And in the end, I just don''t get candid from this.', '2005-01-07 18:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096235, 132302, 18197, '<td valign="top">It may be that you won''t agree with me, but in my mind "candid" implies a photograph of a person at a candid (i.e. unaware of the camera) moment. So, to that way of thinking, this doesn''t really meet the challenge. I suppose you''re breaking new ground ... a candid photo of a landscape.</td>', 'It may be that you won''t agree with me, but in my mind "candid" implies a photograph of a person at a candid (i.e. unaware of the camera) moment. So, to that way of thinking, this doesn''t really meet the challenge. I suppose you''re breaking new ground ... a candid photo of a landscape.', '2005-01-07 18:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
