(1096607, 132715, 4767, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  I love the feeling of this photo.  the warm directional light on the woman as well as the naked trees defines these subjects, though the shot may be a lesson in bokeh.  The negative space of the shadow on the right is powerful as well, drawing the eye in that direction, inviting the woman into the shadow.</td>', 'Hmmm.  I love the feeling of this photo.  the warm directional light on the woman as well as the naked trees defines these subjects, though the shot may be a lesson in bokeh.  The negative space of the shadow on the right is powerful as well, drawing the eye in that direction, inviting the woman into the shadow.', '2005-01-08 00:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
