(1096954, 132250, 26151, '<td valign="top">I think one will do very well, because it is a great photograph. But you may lose some points because she is looking directly at you, so there is no telling if it is really candid or not. Maybe she turned to look at you the moment you pressed the shutter button, maybe she was looking at you the whole time. It''s a great portrait regardless.</td>', 'I think one will do very well, because it is a great photograph. But you may lose some points because she is looking directly at you, so there is no telling if it is really candid or not. Maybe she turned to look at you the moment you pressed the shutter button, maybe she was looking at you the whole time. It''s a great portrait regardless.', '2005-01-08 11:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096968, 132639, 26151, '<td valign="top">Great candid photo. I''m thinking maybe a shorter depth of field (or a crop), with the focus on the white haired gentleman in the front. He is by far the most interesting subject in the photo. But it still works like this too, catching everyone on their way to the market.</td>', 'Great candid photo. I''m thinking maybe a shorter depth of field (or a crop), with the focus on the white haired gentleman in the front. He is by far the most interesting subject in the photo. But it still works like this too, catching everyone on their way to the market.', '2005-01-08 11:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096971, 132821, 26151, '<td valign="top">Great picture of fireworks display. But as I''m sure others are telling you, there''s nothing candid about it.</td>', 'Great picture of fireworks display. But as I''m sure others are telling you, there''s nothing candid about it.', '2005-01-08 11:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
