(1097031, 132605, 28261, '<td valign="top">Artsy, surreal, reminds me of Land of the Giants in a way.  A bit disappointed in the 50% land, 50% water perspective as a 1/3 perspective would push the art a bit more, but overall a great way to add something very unique to an otherwise boring candid.  A 6.</td>', 'Artsy, surreal, reminds me of Land of the Giants in a way.  A bit disappointed in the 50% land, 50% water perspective as a 1/3 perspective would push the art a bit more, but overall a great way to add something very unique to an otherwise boring candid.  A 6.', '2005-01-08 12:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097035, 132513, 26151, '<td valign="top">What would have been a better candid shot would be a clear close up of the kids watching, or any other people watching. The clown''s picture was expected to be taken, if you know what I mean. Still a good picture though.</td>', 'What would have been a better candid shot would be a clear close up of the kids watching, or any other people watching. The clown''s picture was expected to be taken, if you know what I mean. Still a good picture though.', '2005-01-08 12:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097038, 131225, 28261, '<td valign="top">3rds and be d@mnd on this one.  It''s great.  Has a fine art feel to it, is a little on the dark side, but would make a great addition to any wall.  While it does not seem to need a border, I don''t think it detracts at all.  Looks like the Mt Washington''s Hallways.  Bumping to an 8</td>', '3rds and be d@mnd on this one.  It''s great.  Has a fine art feel to it, is a little on the dark side, but would make a great addition to any wall.  While it does not seem to need a border, I don''t think it detracts at all.  Looks like the Mt Washington''s Hallways.  Bumping to an 8', '2005-01-08 12:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097042, 131529, 28261, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones, great placement of subjects on a 3rds rule, excellent use of the background image to balance the whole.  A bit of a blowout on the railing and the white arm in the corner is somewhat distracting, but a great image anyway.  Bumping to an 8</td>', 'Very nice tones, great placement of subjects on a 3rds rule, excellent use of the background image to balance the whole.  A bit of a blowout on the railing and the white arm in the corner is somewhat distracting, but a great image anyway.  Bumping to an 8', '2005-01-08 12:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097046, 132251, 28261, '<td valign="top">I started this image on the low end of my rating blocks, but in reviewing it deeper find that I am intrigued by it.  The blown out window is placed perfectly, the child off centered just enough and it is simple to a T.  A bit of burning in the hair to remove highlights and this image would be outstanding.  It does not ooze ''candid'', although I am sure that it fits the challenge.  I find nothing else I can comment on here.  I like the image, it would draw me in for another look and I think some people other than imediate family members would find it an inteesting piece to hang on a wall either framed or as a poster.  Bumping from a 3 holder to a 6.<br/> <br/>Revisiting this one and bumping again to a 7</td>', 'I started this image on the low end of my rating blocks, but in reviewing it deeper find that I am intrigued by it.  The blown out window is placed perfectly, the child off centered just enough and it is simple to a T.  A bit of burning in the hair to remove highlights and this image would be outstanding.  It does not ooze ''candid'', although I am sure that it fits the challenge.  I find nothing else I can comment on here.  I like the image, it would draw me in for another look and I think some people other than imediate family members would find it an inteesting piece to hang on a wall either framed or as a poster.  Bumping from a 3 holder to a 6. Revisiting this one and bumping again to a 7', '2005-01-08 12:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097048, 131286, 29909, '<td valign="top">The expressions of the three skateboarders is really well captured while the officer as the enforcement figure maintains some anonymity - nice picture</td>', 'The expressions of the three skateboarders is really well captured while the officer as the enforcement figure maintains some anonymity - nice picture', '2005-01-08 12:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097049, 132521, 26151, '<td valign="top">Nice candid shot, but I''m not sure the selective desat was neccessary here. For me anyway.</td>', 'Nice candid shot, but I''m not sure the selective desat was neccessary here. For me anyway.', '2005-01-08 12:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097050, 131570, 28261, '<td valign="top">While I like the grain and the subject seems very candid, there is a lack of detail lost to the shadows that detracts from the whole.  Darker areas are blobs of black and not clothing or shadows.  This can be adjusted in a way by using the duplicate layers in PS and switching to screen until you get to the exposure you wish to have, then just black out the overexposed areas on the layers to return the correctly exposed areas to normal.  A 7.</td>', 'While I like the grain and the subject seems very candid, there is a lack of detail lost to the shadows that detracts from the whole.  Darker areas are blobs of black and not clothing or shadows.  This can be adjusted in a way by using the duplicate layers in PS and switching to screen until you get to the exposure you wish to have, then just black out the overexposed areas on the layers to return the correctly exposed areas to normal.  A 7.', '2005-01-08 12:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097055, 132634, 29909, '<td valign="top">The color contrast is exceptional and the expression on his face is priceless - nice photo</td>', 'The color contrast is exceptional and the expression on his face is priceless - nice photo', '2005-01-08 12:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097060, 132799, 26151, '<td valign="top">If this is really a candid shot of someone you don''t know, you better hope he doesn''t see this, or he''ll come looking you.</td>', 'If this is really a candid shot of someone you don''t know, you better hope he doesn''t see this, or he''ll come looking you.', '2005-01-08 12:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097062, 131510, 29909, '<td valign="top">This picture really makes you want to ask, "what happened?" nice photo</td>', 'This picture really makes you want to ask, "what happened?" nice photo', '2005-01-08 12:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097064, 131865, 29909, '<td valign="top">I like the color contrasts and his expression really does match the sign he is holding - very nice</td>', 'I like the color contrasts and his expression really does match the sign he is holding - very nice', '2005-01-08 12:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097068, 132740, 26151, '<td valign="top">Let me guess, 17% is the percentile you think ths photo will come in for the challenge. That''s all I can figure it means. Unless something in that flyer is 17% off.</td>', 'Let me guess, 17% is the percentile you think ths photo will come in for the challenge. That''s all I can figure it means. Unless something in that flyer is 17% off.', '2005-01-08 12:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097071, 132567, 26151, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2005-01-08 12:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097145, 131708, 23891, '<td valign="top">I can''t vote, but this is my favorite! What a beaut! (The picture AND the girl.)</td>', 'I can''t vote, but this is my favorite! What a beaut! (The picture AND the girl.)', '2005-01-08 13:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097148, 132773, 30490, '<td valign="top">Too Blurry</td>', 'Too Blurry', '2005-01-08 13:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097154, 131378, 30490, '<td valign="top">Too Blurry</td>', 'Too Blurry', '2005-01-08 13:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097155, 131570, 30490, '<td valign="top">too grainy</td>', 'too grainy', '2005-01-08 13:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097158, 131965, 30490, '<td valign="top">too small</td>', 'too small', '2005-01-08 13:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097159, 131189, 30490, '<td valign="top">too blurry</td>', 'too blurry', '2005-01-08 13:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097162, 131692, 30490, '<td valign="top">nice composition, unfortunately the girl''s face is slightly out of focus</td>', 'nice composition, unfortunately the girl''s face is slightly out of focus', '2005-01-08 13:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097271, 132569, 28261, '<td valign="top">This shot does have a candid feel to it, but also feels like little more than a average snapshot.  It holds a story that would have been better told by zooming in on the child facing us who appears to be looking at one of the leeches captured.  This would have eliminated the overexposed highlights on the second child''s back and left us with some very strong leading lines and no distracting extras like the float.  Some slight dodging in the facial shadows of the main subject would then bring out the real subject.  Overall a nice capture, but too wide an angle to have a big impact.  Rating: 5.</td>', 'This shot does have a candid feel to it, but also feels like little more than a average snapshot.  It holds a story that would have been better told by zooming in on the child facing us who appears to be looking at one of the leeches captured.  This would have eliminated the overexposed highlights on the second child''s back and left us with some very strong leading lines and no distracting extras like the float.  Some slight dodging in the facial shadows of the main subject would then bring out the real subject.  Overall a nice capture, but too wide an angle to have a big impact.  Rating: 5.', '2005-01-08 16:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097274, 132368, 28261, '<td valign="top">Originally placed in the mid-range holder, this image is very strong for the mood and essence of candid (even if it is not the typical subject-human).  Most of the whites are textured, and not lost by blowout exposure, although the hind end of the bird could use a bit more detail or curve, it is not distracting.  The neck however is overexposed on top.  Some slight burning in selected areas and this would be finessed.  I like it and am bumping from a 5 to a 7.</td>', 'Originally placed in the mid-range holder, this image is very strong for the mood and essence of candid (even if it is not the typical subject-human).  Most of the whites are textured, and not lost by blowout exposure, although the hind end of the bird could use a bit more detail or curve, it is not distracting.  The neck however is overexposed on top.  Some slight burning in selected areas and this would be finessed.  I like it and am bumping from a 5 to a 7.', '2005-01-08 16:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097276, 132595, 28261, '<td valign="top">I have looked at this one many times.  The old feeling to the color choice, the wide(squared) crop and everything that has been included work well to minimize the man''s presence while not pushing him so far back as to make him unimportant.  It is candid and the extra stuff from the wares for sale all the way to the tiled floor add to the ambiance.  Only the highlight on his face seems somewhat diastracting to me and could easily be taken care of with a slight burn.  Jumping from 6 to 8.</td>', 'I have looked at this one many times.  The old feeling to the color choice, the wide(squared) crop and everything that has been included work well to minimize the man''s presence while not pushing him so far back as to make him unimportant.  It is candid and the extra stuff from the wares for sale all the way to the tiled floor add to the ambiance.  Only the highlight on his face seems somewhat diastracting to me and could easily be taken care of with a slight burn.  Jumping from 6 to 8.', '2005-01-08 16:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097277, 131708, 28261, '<td valign="top">If this is truely not a staged shot, then it is serendipity and planning at it best.  Excellent DOF use, and softening of skin...ah crap, it''s just freakin awesome OK?  Bumpt to a 10.</td>', 'If this is truely not a staged shot, then it is serendipity and planning at it best.  Excellent DOF use, and softening of skin...ah crap, it''s just freakin awesome OK?  Bumpt to a 10.', '2005-01-08 16:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097278, 132106, 28261, '<td valign="top">A lower depth of field would have done nicely to minimize the background elements, but the crop has also achieved a good minimizing of their effects.  The color tones work well together and her expression is priceless for the candidness.  I don''t find the border to be distracting or overdone and all the elements seem to be in just the right place.  Bumpt from 7 to 8.</td>', 'A lower depth of field would have done nicely to minimize the background elements, but the crop has also achieved a good minimizing of their effects.  The color tones work well together and her expression is priceless for the candidness.  I don''t find the border to be distracting or overdone and all the elements seem to be in just the right place.  Bumpt from 7 to 8.', '2005-01-08 16:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097280, 131712, 30555, '<td valign="top">Great photo, I wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'Great photo, I wouldn''t change a thing.', '2005-01-08 16:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097282, 131684, 28261, '<td valign="top">This is a great image hurt only by the lack of definition in the hair that becomes shadow.  A slight tweak in curves or use of the dodge tool on the top of his head might correct this and push the image up a couple notches.  The whistle is also lost in the dof shadow, which really hurts the whole as it is part and parcel of the main subject.  Since this is a desat, I would suggest offestting color and monochrome between the subject and the background.  This would create the contrast you need to fully define his outline.  How?:  Create a duplicate layer of the original, and desat only that layer.  Click the history brush tool into the color layers selection box and then select the desat layer.  Brush in the color where it should be.  A 6 with a big potential to be a 9.</td>', 'This is a great image hurt only by the lack of definition in the hair that becomes shadow.  A slight tweak in curves or use of the dodge tool on the top of his head might correct this and push the image up a couple notches.  The whistle is also lost in the dof shadow, which really hurts the whole as it is part and parcel of the main subject.  Since this is a desat, I would suggest offestting color and monochrome between the subject and the background.  This would create the contrast you need to fully define his outline.  How?:  Create a duplicate layer of the original, and desat only that layer.  Click the history brush tool into the color layers selection box and then select the desat layer.  Brush in the color where it should be.  A 6 with a big potential to be a 9.', '2005-01-08 16:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097284, 132250, 28261, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  The face and detail of the age lines and clarity of the eyes is great.  I think a bit soft on the DOF left as it seems her hair and arm should also be in focus.  The highlights on this side seem too strong and draw the eye away from the subject.  Overall tho a strong image.  Bumping to 8</td>', 'I like this shot.  The face and detail of the age lines and clarity of the eyes is great.  I think a bit soft on the DOF left as it seems her hair and arm should also be in focus.  The highlights on this side seem too strong and draw the eye away from the subject.  Overall tho a strong image.  Bumping to 8', '2005-01-08 16:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097363, 132683, 27847, '<td valign="top">What can I say, this is one of the top candid shots I''ve seen so far. You got everythink in this shot. Top marks from me. Only think I would have change is that yellow border, as I''ve been told before ... these kinds of borders in a frame never improve the shot but take away from it. For Your Info. Still awesome.</td>', 'What can I say, this is one of the top candid shots I''ve seen so far. You got everythink in this shot. Top marks from me. Only think I would have change is that yellow border, as I''ve been told before ... these kinds of borders in a frame never improve the shot but take away from it. For Your Info. Still awesome.', '2005-01-08 19:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097385, 132760, 1717, '<td valign="top">outstanding! very stirring and emotive shot.  the composition and colors are just beautiful....10</td>', 'outstanding! very stirring and emotive shot.  the composition and colors are just beautiful....10', '2005-01-08 19:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097403, 131707, 1717, '<td valign="top">oooh...somethin''s gonna get broken!  great capture!  the brim of his hat shadowing his eyes gives the image just enough tension and menace.  well done!</td>', 'oooh...somethin''s gonna get broken!  great capture!  the brim of his hat shadowing his eyes gives the image just enough tension and menace.  well done!', '2005-01-08 20:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097412, 132854, 30845, '<td valign="top">You took advantage of a great opportunity but there is no clear subject... the women''s poses are interesting on their own without the background, i.e. crop out the unnecessary elements</td>', 'You took advantage of a great opportunity but there is no clear subject... the women''s poses are interesting on their own without the background, i.e. crop out the unnecessary elements', '2005-01-08 20:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097414, 132611, 30845, '<td valign="top">Try to anticipate the peak of action or gesture; this is a nondescript moment that anyone could have captured.</td>', 'Try to anticipate the peak of action or gesture; this is a nondescript moment that anyone could have captured.', '2005-01-08 20:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097416, 132106, 30845, '<td valign="top">Great expression, could be cropped tighter</td>', 'Great expression, could be cropped tighter', '2005-01-08 20:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097417, 132863, 30845, '<td valign="top">Get closer!  The background doesn''t add anything.</td>', 'Get closer!  The background doesn''t add anything.', '2005-01-08 20:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097419, 131760, 30845, '<td valign="top">Crop out the distracting background... the haze effect is gimmicky, looks very Photoshop</td>', 'Crop out the distracting background... the haze effect is gimmicky, looks very Photoshop', '2005-01-08 20:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097429, 132862, 1717, '<td valign="top">wonderful curves and perspective and i love the tone.  well done!</td>', 'wonderful curves and perspective and i love the tone.  well done!', '2005-01-08 20:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097450, 131865, 31642, '<td valign="top">This picture capture the feeling of the man very well. I understand right awy that he is waiting for something.</td>', 'This picture capture the feeling of the man very well. I understand right awy that he is waiting for something.', '2005-01-08 21:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097459, 131452, 31642, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture and the color is very nice too. I would like to give a higher point if I do not see the man sitting at the right.</td>', 'Interesting picture and the color is very nice too. I would like to give a higher point if I do not see the man sitting at the right.', '2005-01-08 21:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097465, 132282, 31642, '<td valign="top">The only thing that I do not like for this one is the white background</td>', 'The only thing that I do not like for this one is the white background', '2005-01-08 21:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097633, 131529, 12253, '<td valign="top">Funny juxtaposition!  Nice tones.  I am not sure what to make of their expressions.  Might have been fun to stay there and sample some others coming off the ride.</td>', 'Funny juxtaposition!  Nice tones.  I am not sure what to make of their expressions.  Might have been fun to stay there and sample some others coming off the ride.', '2005-01-08 23:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097636, 132627, 12253, '<td valign="top">Superb.</td>', 'Superb.', '2005-01-08 23:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097638, 132862, 12253, '<td valign="top">Love the way this is presented, and the composition with the circular tile and theme works very well.</td>', 'Love the way this is presented, and the composition with the circular tile and theme works very well.', '2005-01-08 23:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097639, 131927, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful moment.  Nice composition and catch.</td>', 'Beautiful moment.  Nice composition and catch.', '2005-01-08 23:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097773, 132786, 30214, '<td valign="top">Excellent crop and lighting, one of my favs</td>', 'Excellent crop and lighting, one of my favs', '2005-01-09 02:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097777, 131927, 30214, '<td valign="top">excellent capture. my favorite in this challenge</td>', 'excellent capture. my favorite in this challenge', '2005-01-09 02:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097778, 132669, 30214, '<td valign="top">great capture. red reflection on the snow looks a little weird - is it real? 7</td>', 'great capture. red reflection on the snow looks a little weird - is it real? 7', '2005-01-09 02:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097779, 131379, 30214, '<td valign="top">great photo, love the tone and texture. 7</td>', 'great photo, love the tone and texture. 7', '2005-01-09 02:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097869, 132250, 28750, '<td valign="top">very good photo</td>', 'very good photo', '2005-01-09 04:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097898, 132626, 31772, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot... the expression on his face speaks volumes.</td>', 'Beautiful shot... the expression on his face speaks volumes.', '2005-01-09 06:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097904, 132734, 30861, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t feel "candid" to me; it''s more of a scenic or mood shot. I wish the horizon were leveled, though.</td>', 'This doesn''t feel "candid" to me; it''s more of a scenic or mood shot. I wish the horizon were leveled, though.', '2005-01-09 06:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097907, 131694, 30861, '<td valign="top">A very nice image, but it does not fit into the candid category imo.</td>', 'A very nice image, but it does not fit into the candid category imo.', '2005-01-09 06:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097911, 131521, 30861, '<td valign="top">Luscious tonalities, rich dark areas. Awkward composition to my eyes, I''d liek to see half as much black behind the figure and more added in the direction to which he''s looking. he''s trapped by this framing.</td>', 'Luscious tonalities, rich dark areas. Awkward composition to my eyes, I''d liek to see half as much black behind the figure and more added in the direction to which he''s looking. he''s trapped by this framing.', '2005-01-09 06:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097913, 132605, 30861, '<td valign="top">Gives me no sense of "candid" at all. Interesting effects.</td>', 'Gives me no sense of "candid" at all. Interesting effects.', '2005-01-09 06:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097916, 132442, 30861, '<td valign="top">A pretty luscious image. I''m not wild about the selective desaturation. Maybe if the red were less agressive it would work better for me.</td>', 'A pretty luscious image. I''m not wild about the selective desaturation. Maybe if the red were less agressive it would work better for me.', '2005-01-09 06:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097919, 132007, 30861, '<td valign="top">A striking image, marred by the artefacts in the sky. Nice control of the dark tones.</td>', 'A striking image, marred by the artefacts in the sky. Nice control of the dark tones.', '2005-01-09 06:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097920, 132489, 30861, '<td valign="top">A striking image/expression. Pity the jacket''s in sharper focus than the right eye. Color''s a little to cyan, a white-balance problem, easily fixed.</td>', 'A striking image/expression. Pity the jacket''s in sharper focus than the right eye. Color''s a little to cyan, a white-balance problem, easily fixed.', '2005-01-09 06:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097921, 132773, 30861, '<td valign="top">more of an abstraction than a candid. zero emotional content.</td>', 'more of an abstraction than a candid. zero emotional content.', '2005-01-09 06:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097922, 131684, 30861, '<td valign="top">thsi would work a whole LOT better if the whistle weren''t lost against the background.</td>', 'thsi would work a whole LOT better if the whistle weren''t lost against the background.', '2005-01-09 06:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097923, 132871, 30861, '<td valign="top">cute and rich, a bit of an overall cyan cast that could be adjusted out</td>', 'cute and rich, a bit of an overall cyan cast that could be adjusted out', '2005-01-09 06:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097924, 132868, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nice nose wrinkles!</td>', 'Nice nose wrinkles!', '2005-01-09 06:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097925, 132712, 30861, '<td valign="top">an intriguing image, marred by what seems to me unrealistic use of selective desaturation. The steam, especially, should not be colored, and why is some of the water behind the bridge tinted, but not the rest of it?</td>', 'an intriguing image, marred by what seems to me unrealistic use of selective desaturation. The steam, especially, should not be colored, and why is some of the water behind the bridge tinted, but not the rest of it?', '2005-01-09 06:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097926, 131225, 30861, '<td valign="top">A strong sense of film noir here</td>', 'A strong sense of film noir here', '2005-01-09 06:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097946, 131927, 3306, '<td valign="top">Wonderful expressions. This is a keeper!</td>', 'Wonderful expressions. This is a keeper!', '2005-01-09 07:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097947, 132636, 3306, '<td valign="top">Happy go lucky. I really like the facial expression on the man and the dog only adds to the overall enjoyment ofthe picture. One of my favorites. Great capture.</td>', 'Happy go lucky. I really like the facial expression on the man and the dog only adds to the overall enjoyment ofthe picture. One of my favorites. Great capture.', '2005-01-09 07:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097954, 132724, 31779, '<td valign="top">For a garbage-hunter those are some pretty fly pants. His coat looks tidy, too. I bet he''s looking for throw-away Christmas presents to sell on Ebay.</td>', 'For a garbage-hunter those are some pretty fly pants. His coat looks tidy, too. I bet he''s looking for throw-away Christmas presents to sell on Ebay.', '2005-01-09 07:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097955, 132626, 27137, '<td valign="top">like it, sham the frame is a bit weird</td>', 'like it, sham the frame is a bit weird', '2005-01-09 07:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097956, 131694, 27137, '<td valign="top">i love the pict, but i do not see the connection with Candid</td>', 'i love the pict, but i do not see the connection with Candid', '2005-01-09 07:27:21.000000', NULL, 1);
