(1098087, 132760, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and composition. But there seems to be a bit too much red. Perhaps it is from playing the instrument (cello?) but it looks as if it has been in the sun too much or like it came from the cold and is now warming up. Same can be seen to some extent on the nose. A slight adjustment of the mix of the red channnel in the channel mixer might easily solve that.</td>', 'Good lighting and composition. But there seems to be a bit too much red. Perhaps it is from playing the instrument (cello?) but it looks as if it has been in the sun too much or like it came from the cold and is now warming up. Same can be seen to some extent on the nose. A slight adjustment of the mix of the red channnel in the channel mixer might easily solve that.', '2005-01-09 10:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
