(1098764, 132636, 28261, '<td valign="top">High Key or overexposed?  Not really sure, but I''m erring on the High Key cuz I think it works.  Bumping from 6 to 8.</td>', 'High Key or overexposed?  Not really sure, but I''m erring on the High Key cuz I think it works.  Bumping from 6 to 8.', '2005-01-09 20:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098766, 132074, 28261, '<td valign="top">Despite the 50% ratio, I like this image and can''t imagine it in a thirds rule world.  The colors work wel together and his expression is great.  One of the few borders that I didn''t really care for, probably because the photo blends right into the white instead of having a clear delineator.  Like thin black, white, thin black.  Overall a very nice image tho.  Bumping to an 8</td>', 'Despite the 50% ratio, I like this image and can''t imagine it in a thirds rule world.  The colors work wel together and his expression is great.  One of the few borders that I didn''t really care for, probably because the photo blends right into the white instead of having a clear delineator.  Like thin black, white, thin black.  Overall a very nice image tho.  Bumping to an 8', '2005-01-09 20:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098786, 132543, 1031, '<td valign="top">Hope the shuuter-click didn''t scare off the prey : )</td>', 'Hope the shuuter-click didn''t scare off the prey : )', '2005-01-09 21:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
