(1098805, 132890, 25742, '<td valign="top">Nice captue, but I don''t understand the desat. Why? OK, it kinda directs your attention to the ppl, but you''re gonna fix on them anyway. And this desat gives the photo a unrealistic feel, just like the BG was pasted in in PS.<br/>Good title.</td>', 'Nice captue, but I don''t understand the desat. Why? OK, it kinda directs your attention to the ppl, but you''re gonna fix on them anyway. And this desat gives the photo a unrealistic feel, just like the BG was pasted in in PS.Good title.', '2005-01-09 21:35:42.000000', NULL, 1);
