(1099342, 131377, 23478, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments... I really liked this shot.  I just came around the corner of the house, and saw these two old sisters leaning out the window gabbing with a cowboy.  I started taking some pictures.  She got mad at me, then I appeased her by promising a copy of the photo to her.<br/> <br/>About the ear &amp; red hat... I could have photoshopped it out, but then this is candid.  So, I left it in.  Also, the same with the rest of her hat, it was hidden by the window frame.  I cropped out the window frame, because it was a big distraction (IMO).  <br/> <br/>Thanks again for the comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-10 19:36:25.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments... I really liked this shot.  I just came around the corner of the house, and saw these two old sisters leaning out the window gabbing with a cowboy.  I started taking some pictures.  She got mad at me, then I appeased her by promising a copy of the photo to her. About the ear & red hat... I could have photoshopped it out, but then this is candid.  So, I left it in.  Also, the same with the rest of her hat, it was hidden by the window frame.  I cropped out the window frame, because it was a big distraction (IMO).   Thanks again for the comments.', '2005-01-10 03:18:59.000000', '2005-01-10 19:36:25.000000', 0),
