(1099486, 131684, 30364, '<td valign="top">I rated this for a (bronze) ribbon, John.  Alas, I feel there is too much fixation on technical "perfection" and not enough on challenge context and creativity.  This image is a whole lot better as a memorable candid photograph than almost all of the shots that placed higher.  Yet 24 people rated it less than 5!    I am about to submit my own first entry.  I guess I''ll get hammered.  Best wishes.  Paul.</td>', 'I rated this for a (bronze) ribbon, John.  Alas, I feel there is too much fixation on technical "perfection" and not enough on challenge context and creativity.  This image is a whole lot better as a memorable candid photograph than almost all of the shots that placed higher.  Yet 24 people rated it less than 5!    I am about to submit my own first entry.  I guess I''ll get hammered.  Best wishes.  Paul.', '2005-01-10 06:27:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1099488, 132611, 30364, '<td valign="top">This was top ten.</td>', 'This was top ten.', '2005-01-10 06:30:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1099491, 131727, 30364, '<td valign="top">You was robbed, Lesley.  I can''t believe that nearly 90 people rated this 5 or less, so maybe I know damn all about good photographs.  Or just maybe they do.  It was a terrific CANDID moment.  Paul.</td>', 'You was robbed, Lesley.  I can''t believe that nearly 90 people rated this 5 or less, so maybe I know damn all about good photographs.  Or just maybe they do.  It was a terrific CANDID moment.  Paul.', '2005-01-10 06:37:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1099497, 132224, 30364, '<td valign="top">76th place is inexplicable to me, James.  I rated this photograph higher than 74 of the 75 above it.  It may not be a visually stunning image, but it is everything a candid portrait should be.  Perhaps you should have included a kid or a cute animal perched on Tom''s shoulder, and to hell with the challenge subject!   Cheers, Paul.</td>', '76th place is inexplicable to me, James.  I rated this photograph higher than 74 of the 75 above it.  It may not be a visually stunning image, but it is everything a candid portrait should be.  Perhaps you should have included a kid or a cute animal perched on Tom''s shoulder, and to hell with the challenge subject!   Cheers, Paul.', '2005-01-10 06:48:49.000000', NULL, 0),
