(1388659, 131529, 11800, '<td valign="top">This is the first time viewing this one. It''s a pretty good psychological study of relationships. She''s all angry and her hands are hidden. Her personality only has expression in the movement of her mouth and the direction of her gaze. He is reaching out for something better. But he isn''t ready to let go of what he now holds. The closed hands would suggest some hesitation. Even the half and half lighting on his face suggests two differing directions.<br/>Anyway. I like it.</td>', 'This is the first time viewing this one. It''s a pretty good psychological study of relationships. She''s all angry and her hands are hidden. Her personality only has expression in the movement of her mouth and the direction of her gaze. He is reaching out for something better. But he isn''t ready to let go of what he now holds. The closed hands would suggest some hesitation. Even the half and half lighting on his face suggests two differing directions.Anyway. I like it.', '2005-05-16 12:05:02.000000', NULL, 0),
