(1729591, 131379, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nico- just ran across this.  It is truly wonderful.  I love the whole thing.  The gentleman''s countenance has a reverence about it. Almost like a modern day holy man. His noble wisdom  shines through - or I hope he''s noble and wise.  Great lighting and softness yet it is clear and detailed. I like that you shot it at a lower perspective so you are actually looking up at him.  Great my friend!!!</td>', 'Nico- just ran across this.  It is truly wonderful.  I love the whole thing.  The gentleman''s countenance has a reverence about it. Almost like a modern day holy man. His noble wisdom  shines through - or I hope he''s noble and wise.  Great lighting and softness yet it is clear and detailed. I like that you shot it at a lower perspective so you are actually looking up at him.  Great my friend!!!', '2005-09-22 01:28:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2001992, 132893, 14603, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning shot. I didn`t vote in that challenge, which is a pity as this would have received a ten from me. I can`t quite believe that it scored sub six.<br/> <br/>One of my ambitions has been to recreate the pic on John Lennon`s "Rock and Roll" album which was taken way back in the early sixties in Germany, where he`s standing in a doorway (pin sharp) while all the pedestrians are blurred as they walk by...this reminds me of that pic with the slightly "anarchic" mood it creates.<br/>Truly brilliant.<br/>Great title by the way !!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-04 08:04:04.</i></td>', 'This is a stunning shot. I didn`t vote in that challenge, which is a pity as this would have received a ten from me. I can`t quite believe that it scored sub six. One of my ambitions has been to recreate the pic on John Lennon`s "Rock and Roll" album which was taken way back in the early sixties in Germany, where he`s standing in a doorway (pin sharp) while all the pedestrians are blurred as they walk by...this reminds me of that pic with the slightly "anarchic" mood it creates.Truly brilliant.Great title by the way !!', '2006-01-04 08:03:15.000000', '2006-01-04 08:04:04.000000', 0),
