(2685446, 131380, 37719, '<td valign="top">Such a good and telling photo.  Candid - absolutely!  Well shot and composed - most definitely!  Really nice work Robert and not your usual fare.  Very underrated in my opinion.  The processing is just right and really adds to the overall composition.  I love the natural b&amp;w with the hint of color.  Well done Robert!</td>', 'Such a good and telling photo.  Candid - absolutely!  Well shot and composed - most definitely!  Really nice work Robert and not your usual fare.  Very underrated in my opinion.  The processing is just right and really adds to the overall composition.  I love the natural b&w with the hint of color.  Well done Robert!', '2006-08-01 22:28:41.000000', NULL, 0),
